(1030175, 123452, 22384, '<td valign="top">Indeed. Nice lighting on the bible and crucifix. The harsh lighting on the candle(?) is distracting for me. I would crop it out and let the power of your main images take centerstage. Really beautiful lighting on the apex of the curve on each page. Stunning image without the distraction from the top.</td>', 'Indeed. Nice lighting on the bible and crucifix. The harsh lighting on the candle(?) is distracting for me. I would crop it out and let the power of your main images take centerstage. Really beautiful lighting on the apex of the curve on each page. Stunning image without the distraction from the top.', '2004-11-24 00:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030177, 123317, 23913, '<td valign="top">cute bird and well shot i like the framing- GL</td>', 'cute bird and well shot i like the framing- GL', '2004-11-24 00:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
