(1030179, 123207, 26827, '<td valign="top">An interesting interpretation of the theme, but unlike many, this works.  I would desire slightly more balanced lighting, the highlight onthe boy''s face is a bit over-exposed.  Also, the colored pencils in the foreground are a bit coars and grainy.</td>', 'An interesting interpretation of the theme, but unlike many, this works.  I would desire slightly more balanced lighting, the highlight onthe boy''s face is a bit over-exposed.  Also, the colored pencils in the foreground are a bit coars and grainy.', '2004-11-24 00:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
