(1030277, 123305, 25464, '<td valign="top">This one will probably get picked on for the blown out sky on the right; however, I think it adds to the drama of the photo.  I think this is a unique veiw on the challenge and a well taken photo.  I am not sure I would have chosen black and white for this, but I still think it is great. 9.</td>', 'This one will probably get picked on for the blown out sky on the right; however, I think it adds to the drama of the photo.  I think this is a unique veiw on the challenge and a well taken photo.  I am not sure I would have chosen black and white for this, but I still think it is great. 9.', '2004-11-24 01:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030280, 122756, 26827, '<td valign="top">If the track list were just a bit soft in comparison to the warning label, they would completely relinquish all attention.  As it is, they draw it somewhat.</td>', 'If the track list were just a bit soft in comparison to the warning label, they would completely relinquish all attention.  As it is, they draw it somewhat.', '2004-11-24 01:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030282, 123530, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice use of line and contrast of line. The shiny clean image certainly match the image of the Mayo clinic I have in my mind''s eye. The brilliant blue sky and the shiny metal work so well together. It is rather dizzying, though, which counters the idea of stability I have when I think of the Mayo Clinic. It does give a sense of limitless possibility, so I guess it does work well. I just to have to step back and let go of my preconceived ideas. Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice use of line and contrast of line. The shiny clean image certainly match the image of the Mayo clinic I have in my mind''s eye. The brilliant blue sky and the shiny metal work so well together. It is rather dizzying, though, which counters the idea of stability I have when I think of the Mayo Clinic. It does give a sense of limitless possibility, so I guess it does work well. I just to have to step back and let go of my preconceived ideas. Nice photo.', '2004-11-24 01:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030283, 123517, 25464, '<td valign="top">Bright, colorful, illustrative of challenge.  Good job. 8.</td>', 'Bright, colorful, illustrative of challenge.  Good job. 8.', '2004-11-24 01:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
