(1030286, 123046, 25464, '<td valign="top">Well, I really thought stop sign photos would be BORING.  I have to eat my words.  This one is very well done and not boring at all. 7.</td>', 'Well, I really thought stop sign photos would be BORING.  I have to eat my words.  This one is very well done and not boring at all. 7.', '2004-11-24 01:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
