(1030833, 123338, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice framing but the DOF is totally off here IMO.  If you would have included the fly and her front part insted of her rear I am pretty sure it would have been a killer shot.  Good colours and good composition.</td>', 'Good idea and nice framing but the DOF is totally off here IMO.  If you would have included the fly and her front part insted of her rear I am pretty sure it would have been a killer shot.  Good colours and good composition.', '2004-11-24 06:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030834, 123289, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, cute dog, great focus and composition.  this image has everything, including a very tenuous tie to the challenge...</td>', 'beautiful colors, cute dog, great focus and composition.  this image has everything, including a very tenuous tie to the challenge...', '2004-11-24 06:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
