(1030840, 123381, 20774, '<td valign="top">The photo is very distratcing. The Letters under the plate aren''t really helping and the lobster seems out of focus, But the ideia is really nice. good creativatiy.</td>', 'The photo is very distratcing. The Letters under the plate aren''t really helping and the lobster seems out of focus, But the ideia is really nice. good creativatiy.', '2004-11-24 06:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
