(1030904, 122582, 23394, '<td valign="top">the color and imagery work, especially the lighting.  however, for the large percentage of people never exposed to this work (or not accepting of it), it might miss its mark.  i also think this could benefit from a much sharper focus.</td>', 'the color and imagery work, especially the lighting.  however, for the large percentage of people never exposed to this work (or not accepting of it), it might miss its mark.  i also think this could benefit from a much sharper focus.', '2004-11-24 08:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030907, 122905, 26361, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  Great humor and arrangement.</td>', 'Awesome shot!  Great humor and arrangement.', '2004-11-24 08:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030912, 123346, 26361, '<td valign="top">Love the lady in the background!  Great idea.</td>', 'Love the lady in the background!  Great idea.', '2004-11-24 08:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030916, 123432, 23394, '<td valign="top">this would have been a strong entry in the bw challenge, not so sure about this one.  yes, the rules of math are indisputable, but they are unknown by most and easily ignored.  a major component of authority is the ability to command respect, and for the purposes of this challenge, you would need to address the ability to enforce the laws, and/or the consequences of not following (for example, a person stretched out on the ground with a large rock next to him:  the enforcement of the law of gravity).  all the same, i''ll score this a 6 and wish you good luck!</td>', 'this would have been a strong entry in the bw challenge, not so sure about this one.  yes, the rules of math are indisputable, but they are unknown by most and easily ignored.  a major component of authority is the ability to command respect, and for the purposes of this challenge, you would need to address the ability to enforce the laws, and/or the consequences of not following (for example, a person stretched out on the ground with a large rock next to him:  the enforcement of the law of gravity).  all the same, i''ll score this a 6 and wish you good luck!', '2004-11-24 08:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030920, 123452, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting composition, but unable to tell what the object at the top is.  is that the light source? is it a votif?  when i cover the top of the image with my hand, the image seems a bit stronger.  i don''t mind the grain, and do understand the limits of what you can do under basic editing, but wish you could have sharpened the text and taken out the hot spots on the crucifix.  good luck!</td>', 'interesting composition, but unable to tell what the object at the top is.  is that the light source? is it a votif?  when i cover the top of the image with my hand, the image seems a bit stronger.  i don''t mind the grain, and do understand the limits of what you can do under basic editing, but wish you could have sharpened the text and taken out the hot spots on the crucifix.  good luck!', '2004-11-24 08:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030924, 123532, 28260, '<td valign="top">Very good shot as well as a nice play with physics!<br/>Most people do not understand what light will do when it passes through the various optics in a lens.  <br/></td>', 'Very good shot as well as a nice play with physics!Most people do not understand what light will do when it passes through the various optics in a lens.  ', '2004-11-24 08:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030926, 123442, 27574, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites...I love it with just the two colors.  I would have increased the saturation just a tad.  Just amazing</td>', 'This is one of my favorites...I love it with just the two colors.  I would have increased the saturation just a tad.  Just amazing', '2004-11-24 08:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030927, 123432, 12362, '<td valign="top">Great placement of the subject. 8</td>', 'Great placement of the subject. 8', '2004-11-24 08:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030929, 123234, 12362, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the light is a little blown out.</td>', 'Good idea, but the light is a little blown out.', '2004-11-24 08:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030931, 123338, 12362, '<td valign="top">good idea, but the spider is out of focus. 7 is it was in focus, 5 without.</td>', 'good idea, but the spider is out of focus. 7 is it was in focus, 5 without.', '2004-11-24 08:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030934, 123251, 27839, '<td valign="top">One of my Favorites!</td>', 'One of my Favorites!', '2004-11-24 08:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030935, 123289, 27574, '<td valign="top">ahhhh poor baby..our dog had one of those and he was so humiliated.  Nice pic love all the red and  the reflections of the red</td>', 'ahhhh poor baby..our dog had one of those and he was so humiliated.  Nice pic love all the red and  the reflections of the red', '2004-11-24 08:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030936, 123305, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like the composition, but am struggling with the execution.  you could definitely use a lens hood to cut down on the lens flare (which is a major distraction).  i know this was a tough shot to take and to process, especially trying to capture the detail that you did, without allowing too much blow out.  all the same, i''ll score this a 6 and wish you good luck!</td>', 'i like the composition, but am struggling with the execution.  you could definitely use a lens hood to cut down on the lens flare (which is a major distraction).  i know this was a tough shot to take and to process, especially trying to capture the detail that you did, without allowing too much blow out.  all the same, i''ll score this a 6 and wish you good luck!', '2004-11-24 08:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030937, 123489, 27574, '<td valign="top">Great ...really says a lot, doesn''t it.</td>', 'Great ...really says a lot, doesn''t it.', '2004-11-24 08:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030938, 123455, 26361, '<td valign="top">Very amusing interpretation of theme.  Nicely done border.</td>', 'Very amusing interpretation of theme.  Nicely done border.', '2004-11-24 08:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030941, 123253, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge, though i would image the blur to be a little stronger after 12...lol.  good luck!</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge, though i would image the blur to be a little stronger after 12...lol.  good luck!', '2004-11-24 08:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030943, 122905, 27839, '<td valign="top">Great photo! I love the way the Nun is in the middle and you are catching the view from behind the students!  Again, this is great!</td>', 'Great photo! I love the way the Nun is in the middle and you are catching the view from behind the students!  Again, this is great!', '2004-11-24 08:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030945, 122976, 27839, '<td valign="top">This photo seems to be a little washed out.  Maybe the light is to harsh.</td>', 'This photo seems to be a little washed out.  Maybe the light is to harsh.', '2004-11-24 08:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030946, 123455, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting, whimsical take on the challenge.  could probably use a better title.  i''m scoring this a 6, but would suggest revisiting this after the challenge and playing with different crops and placements of the card and game piece (they are a little too far apart).  good luck!</td>', 'interesting, whimsical take on the challenge.  could probably use a better title.  i''m scoring this a 6, but would suggest revisiting this after the challenge and playing with different crops and placements of the card and game piece (they are a little too far apart).  good luck!', '2004-11-24 08:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030947, 123214, 23394, '<td valign="top">you''ve got my attention, too!  good take on the challenge.  the shot may come across as boring, but all the same, it definitely represents authority.  good luck!</td>', 'you''ve got my attention, too!  good take on the challenge.  the shot may come across as boring, but all the same, it definitely represents authority.  good luck!', '2004-11-24 08:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030948, 123446, 27839, '<td valign="top">I really like the shadows in this photo.  The shadows really make this photo!</td>', 'I really like the shadows in this photo.  The shadows really make this photo!', '2004-11-24 08:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030950, 123034, 27839, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo.  You found a boring sign in front of great scenery.</td>', 'This is a really nice photo.  You found a boring sign in front of great scenery.', '2004-11-24 08:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030951, 122377, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting composition.  the lighting is really effective, the way you''ve allowed the red to really speak while maintaining the muted colors in the shadows.  not sure, but wondering if it would have been stronger if the sign wasn''t so dead-on?</td>', 'interesting composition.  the lighting is really effective, the way you''ve allowed the red to really speak while maintaining the muted colors in the shadows.  not sure, but wondering if it would have been stronger if the sign wasn''t so dead-on?', '2004-11-24 08:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030960, 122885, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge.  i think your image would have been stronger if you had gone on and cropped out the top down to just below the sign edge--that stuff adds nothing.  this really looks like a fun place to visit, and i''m sure the city council will be approaching you to for permission to reprint this in all the tourist literature &lt;g&gt;.  good luck, 6 from me.</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge.  i think your image would have been stronger if you had gone on and cropped out the top down to just below the sign edge--that stuff adds nothing.  this really looks like a fun place to visit, and i''m sure the city council will be approaching you to for permission to reprint this in all the tourist literature <g>.  good luck, 6 from me.', '2004-11-24 08:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030969, 122413, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting and colors of your image.  the one thing that would have really bumped it up would have been a deeper dof and absolutely razor-sharp focus.  all the same, i''ll score it a 6 and wish you the best of luck.<br/> <br/>[as an aside, not that this has anything to with scoring, but all caps in the title are a little hard on the eyes, almost like visual shouting.]</td>', 'i like the lighting and colors of your image.  the one thing that would have really bumped it up would have been a deeper dof and absolutely razor-sharp focus.  all the same, i''ll score it a 6 and wish you the best of luck. [as an aside, not that this has anything to with scoring, but all caps in the title are a little hard on the eyes, almost like visual shouting.]', '2004-11-24 08:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030975, 123489, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is funny!  nice take on the challenge.  one thing you might consider before submitting, though, is to true up your vertical and horizontal lines.  here, it is a little distracting to follow the tilted line down the edge of the sign.  i''ll still score this a 6, but will also say that attention to the little details that you have control over can make a world of difference with the voters...</td>', 'this is funny!  nice take on the challenge.  one thing you might consider before submitting, though, is to true up your vertical and horizontal lines.  here, it is a little distracting to follow the tilted line down the edge of the sign.  i''ll still score this a 6, but will also say that attention to the little details that you have control over can make a world of difference with the voters...', '2004-11-24 08:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030977, 123531, 10985, '<td valign="top">Funny! I love the angle. Not sure about the white curtain, though. It kind of looks added to the brown ones.</td>', 'Funny! I love the angle. Not sure about the white curtain, though. It kind of looks added to the brown ones.', '2004-11-24 09:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030978, 123360, 23394, '<td valign="top">i do not know the foley''s, so there is no way for me to question their authority.  unfortunately, your image does not convey authority to me.  it comes across more as a snapshot that is a little over-exposed.</td>', 'i do not know the foley''s, so there is no way for me to question their authority.  unfortunately, your image does not convey authority to me.  it comes across more as a snapshot that is a little over-exposed.', '2004-11-24 09:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030979, 123539, 26361, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  Thanks for the giggle.  Love the subject you chose for the challenge.  Nice arrangement of items.</td>', 'Too funny!  Thanks for the giggle.  Love the subject you chose for the challenge.  Nice arrangement of items.', '2004-11-24 09:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030980, 122391, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a wild image, but i see nothing conveying authority or control here.</td>', 'this is a wild image, but i see nothing conveying authority or control here.', '2004-11-24 09:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030984, 122830, 10985, '<td valign="top">It would have been nice to see what he sees. The lighting on him is very effective, though.</td>', 'It would have been nice to see what he sees. The lighting on him is very effective, though.', '2004-11-24 09:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030987, 123384, 23394, '<td valign="top">lucky to be able to shoot from this perspective.  it''s a shame that you couldn''t get a shot of a ref exerting his authority on the court...as is, i see guys walking away from someone.  also, the presentation itself would have been stronger if you had rotated it to remove the tilt.  i know this venue didn''t offer the best lighting, but the focus needs to be a little sharper, as well.</td>', 'lucky to be able to shoot from this perspective.  it''s a shame that you couldn''t get a shot of a ref exerting his authority on the court...as is, i see guys walking away from someone.  also, the presentation itself would have been stronger if you had rotated it to remove the tilt.  i know this venue didn''t offer the best lighting, but the focus needs to be a little sharper, as well.', '2004-11-24 09:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030988, 123000, 23394, '<td valign="top">as i can''t really read the sign, all i''m left with is an image of a door.  does not really hit the challenge for me.</td>', 'as i can''t really read the sign, all i''m left with is an image of a door.  does not really hit the challenge for me.', '2004-11-24 09:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030989, 123065, 10985, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t want to see what lurks in there come Christmas... Well presented but a bit blurry.</td>', 'I wouldn''t want to see what lurks in there come Christmas... Well presented but a bit blurry.', '2004-11-24 09:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030990, 122219, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful image, lovely colors.  not really getting the tie to the challenge.</td>', 'beautiful image, lovely colors.  not really getting the tie to the challenge.', '2004-11-24 09:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030994, 123381, 23394, '<td valign="top">even though the title is part of the submission, it should be in a role that supports the image.  here, the title is the only thing tying the image to the challenge.  as far as the image goes, the composition is interesting, but the lighting and focus are off.  the knife is a distraction, and the angle and cropping could be played with to produce a more dynamic result.  also, it might have helped to have wiped the plate clean before shooting.  does any of this matter?  it all depends on what you are trying to accomplish.  if you want to raise your scoring, you really have to pay attention to all of the details (and i know, i''m still struggling here!).  good luck here, and better luck next time!</td>', 'even though the title is part of the submission, it should be in a role that supports the image.  here, the title is the only thing tying the image to the challenge.  as far as the image goes, the composition is interesting, but the lighting and focus are off.  the knife is a distraction, and the angle and cropping could be played with to produce a more dynamic result.  also, it might have helped to have wiped the plate clean before shooting.  does any of this matter?  it all depends on what you are trying to accomplish.  if you want to raise your scoring, you really have to pay attention to all of the details (and i know, i''m still struggling here!).  good luck here, and better luck next time!', '2004-11-24 09:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030996, 123207, 6532, '<td valign="top">Border is way too thick.</td>', 'Border is way too thick.', '2004-11-24 09:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030997, 123315, 10985, '<td valign="top">Funny. Very good fit for the challenge. Great expression and title, and very good job on the lighting.</td>', 'Funny. Very good fit for the challenge. Great expression and title, and very good job on the lighting.', '2004-11-24 09:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1030998, 123294, 23394, '<td valign="top">i understand your intention, but this really does not convey authority.  maybe if someone was keeping bystanders away?  the composition is not helped by the pole splitting it down the middle, and the dof is a bit too shallow.</td>', 'i understand your intention, but this really does not convey authority.  maybe if someone was keeping bystanders away?  the composition is not helped by the pole splitting it down the middle, and the dof is a bit too shallow.', '2004-11-24 09:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031001, 122313, 23394, '<td valign="top">ay-yi-yi...this is blinding.  can''t really offer much here except to say i hope this didn''t hurt you when you took it...</td>', 'ay-yi-yi...this is blinding.  can''t really offer much here except to say i hope this didn''t hurt you when you took it...', '2004-11-24 09:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031004, 123317, 10985, '<td valign="top">I like the neutral bg, the sharpness, good lighting and composition. My only nit is that the eyes seem empty, because the touch the bg a bit and are exactly the same color.</td>', 'I like the neutral bg, the sharpness, good lighting and composition. My only nit is that the eyes seem empty, because the touch the bg a bit and are exactly the same color.', '2004-11-24 09:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031008, 122419, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very good idea! The colors blend in a bit too nicely. Darker pants or a darker wall would have made it even more effective, I think. It would have created a better contrast. But the idea is very good and the image has a strong impact.</td>', 'Very good idea! The colors blend in a bit too nicely. Darker pants or a darker wall would have made it even more effective, I think. It would have created a better contrast. But the idea is very good and the image has a strong impact.', '2004-11-24 09:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031009, 123237, 10985, '<td valign="top">Fun and well presented.</td>', 'Fun and well presented.', '2004-11-24 09:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031011, 123299, 10985, '<td valign="top">Some men''s... over some women. Sad but true.</td>', 'Some men''s... over some women. Sad but true.', '2004-11-24 09:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031013, 123455, 27574, '<td valign="top">Very creative, I really like this one</td>', 'Very creative, I really like this one', '2004-11-24 09:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031015, 123412, 10985, '<td valign="top">Great set-up! I like the idea of the galaxy in the back. Not sure it will be picked up by all, but it''s a cool idea.</td>', 'Great set-up! I like the idea of the galaxy in the back. Not sure it will be picked up by all, but it''s a cool idea.', '2004-11-24 09:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031018, 123251, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting image.  the shadows on the background are a little distracting.  not really sure how domination equates to authority, especially symbolized by a whip (i mean, i can more easily see a gun as a symbol of enforcing authority), and especially without any other context.  the composition is ok, the lighting fine, and the focus is sharp enough.  just really not seeing the subject as a strong tie to the challenge.</td>', 'interesting image.  the shadows on the background are a little distracting.  not really sure how domination equates to authority, especially symbolized by a whip (i mean, i can more easily see a gun as a symbol of enforcing authority), and especially without any other context.  the composition is ok, the lighting fine, and the focus is sharp enough.  just really not seeing the subject as a strong tie to the challenge.', '2004-11-24 09:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031022, 123428, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i concur whole-heartedly with the sentiment, the execution is too snap-shotty.  i don''t know if it was due to flash, or how you set up the lighting, but the shadows are too strong.  these are tough, tough images to capture (that is, working with children).  good luck.</td>', 'while i concur whole-heartedly with the sentiment, the execution is too snap-shotty.  i don''t know if it was due to flash, or how you set up the lighting, but the shadows are too strong.  these are tough, tough images to capture (that is, working with children).  good luck.', '2004-11-24 09:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031024, 123034, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is funny!</td>', 'this is funny!', '2004-11-24 09:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031027, 123223, 23394, '<td valign="top">cute shot.  too bad the flash blew out the signage.  not really fond of the border.  also wondering how well the image would stand up in the challenge without the title...</td>', 'cute shot.  too bad the flash blew out the signage.  not really fond of the border.  also wondering how well the image would stand up in the challenge without the title...', '2004-11-24 09:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
