(1031031, 123344, 23394, '<td valign="top">great perspective.  don''t know why you desaturated this, unless the sky offered no color.  i imagine this would be a great shot with an ice blue, cloudless sky.  good luck!</td>', 'great perspective.  don''t know why you desaturated this, unless the sky offered no color.  i imagine this would be a great shot with an ice blue, cloudless sky.  good luck!', '2004-11-24 09:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
