(1031035, 123449, 23394, '<td valign="top">i see a wreck, but no authority figure.  who is in control here, keeping the spectators at bay?  even without the challenge, the composition doesn''t really take you into the image.  a better perspective might have been from closer in while an authority figure was examining the incident.</td>', 'i see a wreck, but no authority figure.  who is in control here, keeping the spectators at bay?  even without the challenge, the composition doesn''t really take you into the image.  a better perspective might have been from closer in while an authority figure was examining the incident.', '2004-11-24 09:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031038, 122315, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a cute snapshot, but not really an image that represents authority.  also, in the future, you might want to increase the size of your submissions (you can go as long as 640 pixels on the longest side).</td>', 'this is a cute snapshot, but not really an image that represents authority.  also, in the future, you might want to increase the size of your submissions (you can go as long as 640 pixels on the longest side).', '2004-11-24 09:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031040, 122869, 27845, '<td valign="top">Huh? Sorry, but what does that title mean? And, except for the word authority in the title, I can''t see what this picture has to do with it.<br/>I''d have put that guy either on the right side of the graffiti or made him turn around. He''s facing the left side of the picture, the graffitti is in his back. The eye is led away from it!</td>', 'Huh? Sorry, but what does that title mean? And, except for the word authority in the title, I can''t see what this picture has to do with it.I''d have put that guy either on the right side of the graffiti or made him turn around. He''s facing the left side of the picture, the graffitti is in his back. The eye is led away from it!', '2004-11-24 09:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031043, 123303, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, this is an authority figure.  too bad you couldn''t catch him exerting his authority : (  also, it can really make a difference scoring if you true up your horizons, rotating your images to remove the tilt.  good job with the focus and general composition.</td>', 'yes, this is an authority figure.  too bad you couldn''t catch him exerting his authority : (  also, it can really make a difference scoring if you true up your horizons, rotating your images to remove the tilt.  good job with the focus and general composition.', '2004-11-24 09:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031045, 123317, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice bird shot.  love the detail, coloring, and use of negative space.  great capture of expression, and exceptionally sharp focus and dof.  however, except for being a demanding pet, i don''t really consider this an authority shot...</td>', 'nice bird shot.  love the detail, coloring, and use of negative space.  great capture of expression, and exceptionally sharp focus and dof.  however, except for being a demanding pet, i don''t really consider this an authority shot...', '2004-11-24 09:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
