(1031243, 123346, 13064, '<td valign="top">Now, this is just one form of authority I could relate too.  It is a shame about the movement in the hand of the principle subject.</td>', 'Now, this is just one form of authority I could relate too.  It is a shame about the movement in the hand of the principle subject.', '2004-11-24 11:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031244, 123251, 27158, '<td valign="top">well done...certainly gets the point across!</td>', 'well done...certainly gets the point across!', '2004-11-24 11:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031245, 123017, 26827, '<td valign="top">This may be too regional specific.  I don''t really understand the subject, or its relation to the topic.  Good exposure, the whites are not blown out, and the shadow still has good detail.</td>', 'This may be too regional specific.  I don''t really understand the subject, or its relation to the topic.  Good exposure, the whites are not blown out, and the shadow still has good detail.', '2004-11-24 11:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031247, 123450, 9939, '<td valign="top">very nice idea, I like the setup, though I would have taken care to put some sort of black backdrop behind her. That light in her glasses is distracting as well.</td>', 'very nice idea, I like the setup, though I would have taken care to put some sort of black backdrop behind her. That light in her glasses is distracting as well.', '2004-11-24 11:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031254, 123223, 27158, '<td valign="top">great shot. I never could teach any rules to my girls...much less have them read for themselves</td>', 'great shot. I never could teach any rules to my girls...much less have them read for themselves', '2004-11-24 11:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031255, 122905, 13064, '<td valign="top">Now this is an authority that I recall was higher than GOD!!!!  great humour in the shot. Love it 8/10</td>', 'Now this is an authority that I recall was higher than GOD!!!!  great humour in the shot. Love it 8/10', '2004-11-24 11:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031257, 123286, 26827, '<td valign="top">The table and the (what looks like) pant leg underneath it are unnecesarry.  The lighting from theleft has put too much of an edge highlight on your subject.  Most of the detail around the edge of the book looks blurry, though the middle looks pretty good.</td>', 'The table and the (what looks like) pant leg underneath it are unnecesarry.  The lighting from theleft has put too much of an edge highlight on your subject.  Most of the detail around the edge of the book looks blurry, though the middle looks pretty good.', '2004-11-24 11:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031258, 123055, 9939, '<td valign="top">nice capture!</td>', 'nice capture!', '2004-11-24 11:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031260, 123315, 27158, '<td valign="top">love the expression...nice colors and lighting, as well</td>', 'love the expression...nice colors and lighting, as well', '2004-11-24 11:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031261, 122905, 26827, '<td valign="top">With a shot like this, a more central composition would be stronger.  I would also question, in this instance, shooting against that wall.  The nun''s face is almost the exact same tone.  Very nice, though.</td>', 'With a shot like this, a more central composition would be stronger.  I would also question, in this instance, shooting against that wall.  The nun''s face is almost the exact same tone.  Very nice, though.', '2004-11-24 11:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031262, 122532, 20056, '<td valign="top">I like the picture and the idea! eventhough sometimes we do not agree with the "tattered" one :)</td>', 'I like the picture and the idea! eventhough sometimes we do not agree with the "tattered" one :)', '2004-11-24 11:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031264, 122790, 13064, '<td valign="top">Very striking!!  The whole composition works for me and as a seafarer, it really speaks of authority. 8</td>', 'Very striking!!  The whole composition works for me and as a seafarer, it really speaks of authority. 8', '2004-11-24 11:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031265, 122532, 9939, '<td valign="top">great lighting and "mood" to this shot.</td>', 'great lighting and "mood" to this shot.', '2004-11-24 11:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031266, 123530, 27158, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot...cool angles and sky</td>', 'very interesting shot...cool angles and sky', '2004-11-24 11:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031268, 123441, 26827, '<td valign="top">You''ve obviously chosen to have a very low-key shot.  I have to say it doesn''t work for me.    The clock seems rather awkwardly bent, which is distracting.  The basic choice of composition is good, central and balanced, but with the curve of the clock, the compoistion is lacking.</td>', 'You''ve obviously chosen to have a very low-key shot.  I have to say it doesn''t work for me.    The clock seems rather awkwardly bent, which is distracting.  The basic choice of composition is good, central and balanced, but with the curve of the clock, the compoistion is lacking.', '2004-11-24 11:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031269, 123446, 13064, '<td valign="top">This took a bit to register in my head (maybe because it is 2:47am right now.  But, it really works for me in B&amp;W.  The shadow work is imaginative and effective.  I almost feel sorry for the child!!  9/10</td>', 'This took a bit to register in my head (maybe because it is 2:47am right now.  But, it really works for me in B&W.  The shadow work is imaginative and effective.  I almost feel sorry for the child!!  9/10', '2004-11-24 11:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031270, 123299, 27293, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and very good execution. Original approach too.</td>', 'Excellent composition and very good execution. Original approach too.', '2004-11-24 11:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031271, 122538, 2741, '<td valign="top">In some sick way... I find this kinda sexy. LOL.</td>', 'In some sick way... I find this kinda sexy. LOL.', '2004-11-24 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031272, 123346, 26827, '<td valign="top">Rather gimicky, IMO.  The position you''ve chosen is a hard one to keep sbsolutely still, revealing quite a bit of motion blur.  On a compositional note, the purple flashlight seems unnecesaary.  It is very contrasty and competets with the green of the beer can against the black shirt.</td>', 'Rather gimicky, IMO.  The position you''ve chosen is a hard one to keep sbsolutely still, revealing quite a bit of motion blur.  On a compositional note, the purple flashlight seems unnecesaary.  It is very contrasty and competets with the green of the beer can against the black shirt.', '2004-11-24 11:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031273, 123237, 9939, '<td valign="top">well done.</td>', 'well done.', '2004-11-24 11:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031274, 122538, 24715, '<td valign="top">Why so small? Great pic otherwise.</td>', 'Why so small? Great pic otherwise.', '2004-11-24 11:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031277, 122406, 26827, '<td valign="top">Cute.  The background is so busy against the dinosaurs it makes it a bit more interesting that the dinosaurs.  A duller background (dirt or sand perhaps) and a slightly greater tonal range on the dinosaurs would enhance the shot.</td>', 'Cute.  The background is so busy against the dinosaurs it makes it a bit more interesting that the dinosaurs.  A duller background (dirt or sand perhaps) and a slightly greater tonal range on the dinosaurs would enhance the shot.', '2004-11-24 11:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031282, 123528, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice setup.</td>', 'Great idea, nice setup.', '2004-11-24 11:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031285, 123272, 26827, '<td valign="top">Good composition,  good tones, but the one highlight to the left of "POLICE" is distracting.</td>', 'Good composition,  good tones, but the one highlight to the left of "POLICE" is distracting.', '2004-11-24 11:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031289, 123289, 26827, '<td valign="top">Technically, it seems nice.  Thematicaly, it seems like a very loose connection to the topic.  Laso, not sure the red really works.</td>', 'Technically, it seems nice.  Thematicaly, it seems like a very loose connection to the topic.  Laso, not sure the red really works.', '2004-11-24 11:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031290, 123533, 13064, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. The highlights are really harsh and detract from what you are trying to do.  The background seems to be too prominent and I am sure a tweak at the levels would help in making it hide a bit. The speckles of dust really detract from the shot.  All that aside, because it is on topic and still gets a 5 from me</td>', 'Nice concept. The highlights are really harsh and detract from what you are trying to do.  The background seems to be too prominent and I am sure a tweak at the levels would help in making it hide a bit. The speckles of dust really detract from the shot.  All that aside, because it is on topic and still gets a 5 from me', '2004-11-24 12:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031291, 122379, 26827, '<td valign="top">The angle is unnecesarry in this shot.  It doesn''t give it any more interest and takes away from the appeal.  There is a near-complete lack of detail, but thelights are prettty.  If horizontal, a nice night shot of  city, but I don''t see how this really fits the topic.</td>', 'The angle is unnecesarry in this shot.  It doesn''t give it any more interest and takes away from the appeal.  There is a near-complete lack of detail, but thelights are prettty.  If horizontal, a nice night shot of  city, but I don''t see how this really fits the topic.', '2004-11-24 12:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031292, 123442, 2741, '<td valign="top">not much authority these days</td>', 'not much authority these days', '2004-11-24 12:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031294, 122538, 20056, '<td valign="top">next time a little bigger ... but continue with the same humor :)</td>', 'next time a little bigger ... but continue with the same humor :)', '2004-11-24 12:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031297, 123299, 13064, '<td valign="top">The shot made me cringe due to the content.  I like the composition and the out of focus belt works for me.</td>', 'The shot made me cringe due to the content.  I like the composition and the out of focus belt works for me.', '2004-11-24 12:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031299, 123435, 26827, '<td valign="top">Looks out of focus.  The towel as background is distracting, something smoother.  For the tile, neither the statue nor the glasses is necessary and just adds too many elements.  Some ege have highlights that are getting alittle our of hand, a more diffus elighting setup would help with that.  The subject.... doesn''t really say much to me.</td>', 'Looks out of focus.  The towel as background is distracting, something smoother.  For the tile, neither the statue nor the glasses is necessary and just adds too many elements.  Some ege have highlights that are getting alittle our of hand, a more diffus elighting setup would help with that.  The subject.... doesn''t really say much to me.', '2004-11-24 12:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031304, 122538, 27293, '<td valign="top">!!! Nice, nice nice! Don''t think it will get a whole lot of other 9s, though. It''s a 9 because of the size and a somewhat too harsh of a shadow on the wall. Edit: upgrading to 10. It''s one of the two decent ones in the whole lot.</td>', '!!! Nice, nice nice! Don''t think it will get a whole lot of other 9s, though. It''s a 9 because of the size and a somewhat too harsh of a shadow on the wall. Edit: upgrading to 10. It''s one of the two decent ones in the whole lot.', '2004-11-24 12:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031305, 123513, 20056, '<td valign="top">But... it is clean :)<br/>Somehow not very interesting and composition is not strong enough BUT the idea is GREAT!</td>', 'But... it is clean :)Somehow not very interesting and composition is not strong enough BUT the idea is GREAT!', '2004-11-24 12:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031307, 122419, 13064, '<td valign="top">I like different POV''s. Great depth of field!!</td>', 'I like different POV''s. Great depth of field!!', '2004-11-24 12:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031308, 122391, 26827, '<td valign="top">As an environmental portrait or band shot, I think this could benefit froma shift left or right, bringing her more off center.  Aside from the blur, there is little to suggest to me the title, or the images relation tothe topic.  Good band pic.</td>', 'As an environmental portrait or band shot, I think this could benefit froma shift left or right, bringing her more off center.  Aside from the blur, there is little to suggest to me the title, or the images relation tothe topic.  Good band pic.', '2004-11-24 12:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031311, 123374, 20056, '<td valign="top">;)</td>', ';)', '2004-11-24 12:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031313, 123433, 26827, '<td valign="top">Rather a blah shot for me.  Technically decent, but the frame is so busy there is no real focal point.</td>', 'Rather a blah shot for me.  Technically decent, but the frame is so busy there is no real focal point.', '2004-11-24 12:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031314, 123147, 13064, '<td valign="top">Pity you could not get the traffic branch cop skulking in the bushes (as they always seem to be) as well...  If this is not somewhere in Queensland I will eat my hat! (preparing salt to add to hat now)</td>', 'Pity you could not get the traffic branch cop skulking in the bushes (as they always seem to be) as well...  If this is not somewhere in Queensland I will eat my hat! (preparing salt to add to hat now)', '2004-11-24 12:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031315, 123363, 26827, '<td valign="top">Scary woman trying not to laugh.  I''ll give you the topic, you''re close enough.  The highlight on her face is a little bright.</td>', 'Scary woman trying not to laugh.  I''ll give you the topic, you''re close enough.  The highlight on her face is a little bright.', '2004-11-24 12:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031317, 123478, 26827, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting shots in this challenge.  A little tenuous on topic.  Card doesn''t look quite "on," maybe a faster shutter speed would capture more sharp detail(I''m assuming this was captured while you were tossing the card).  Lighting is about perfect for the effect.</td>', 'One of the more interesting shots in this challenge.  A little tenuous on topic.  Card doesn''t look quite "on," maybe a faster shutter speed would capture more sharp detail(I''m assuming this was captured while you were tossing the card).  Lighting is about perfect for the effect.', '2004-11-24 12:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031322, 123290, 26827, '<td valign="top">The slight angle is just enough to bother me, a shift back to vertical would be better.</td>', 'The slight angle is just enough to bother me, a shift back to vertical would be better.', '2004-11-24 12:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031323, 123251, 13064, '<td valign="top">There ya go...  You hit on one of my weaknesses...  I suppose it depends on your perspective as to what authority this holds. :)</td>', 'There ya go...  You hit on one of my weaknesses...  I suppose it depends on your perspective as to what authority this holds. :)', '2004-11-24 12:15:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1031328, 122681, 24715, '<td valign="top">Just what others said - too small.</td>', 'Just what others said - too small.', '2004-11-24 12:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031329, 123214, 13064, '<td valign="top">Says it all, but be careful taking photos around correctional centres in Queensland.  I was hauled inside and questioned for taking an external shot (for an inservice training document) from a distance a few years ago.  Seems the Corrections Officers got a bit agitated as it was a short time after the escape of a notorious prisoner.</td>', 'Says it all, but be careful taking photos around correctional centres in Queensland.  I was hauled inside and questioned for taking an external shot (for an inservice training document) from a distance a few years ago.  Seems the Corrections Officers got a bit agitated as it was a short time after the escape of a notorious prisoner.', '2004-11-24 12:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031331, 123375, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''m trying really hard to see the link to authority if I don''t consider the title. Do you mean that it is possible to look up the word ''authority'' in a dictionary? That would work with any challenge, then.<br/>The depth of field is nice. The gold letters don''t come out too well, they should be brighter. Now I don''t know how you managed to get those black spots in the middle of the picture in there, but they''re annoying.<br/>I still don''t get the link to the challenge. Sorry.</td>', 'I''m trying really hard to see the link to authority if I don''t consider the title. Do you mean that it is possible to look up the word ''authority'' in a dictionary? That would work with any challenge, then.The depth of field is nice. The gold letters don''t come out too well, they should be brighter. Now I don''t know how you managed to get those black spots in the middle of the picture in there, but they''re annoying.I still don''t get the link to the challenge. Sorry.', '2004-11-24 12:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031334, 122830, 24715, '<td valign="top">Must be invisible world, Atlas! Great composition, contrast and shades.</td>', 'Must be invisible world, Atlas! Great composition, contrast and shades.', '2004-11-24 12:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031336, 123346, 27845, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this is funny. I guess that''s your wife in the background? I like how you made her look as if she was your bad conscience. However the long exposure caused some heavy blur on you/your male model. The scenery isn''t too interesting I must admit. There are too many details in the background which take the eye''s attraction from the main subject. A pub would have been nicer as location. And that torchlight on the right hasn''t got anything to do in there. It doesn''t add to the picture.</td>', 'Yeah, this is funny. I guess that''s your wife in the background? I like how you made her look as if she was your bad conscience. However the long exposure caused some heavy blur on you/your male model. The scenery isn''t too interesting I must admit. There are too many details in the background which take the eye''s attraction from the main subject. A pub would have been nicer as location. And that torchlight on the right hasn''t got anything to do in there. It doesn''t add to the picture.', '2004-11-24 12:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031339, 123480, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''d not have cropped the top of his head and the left of the flag. The picture might use some more colour, too.<br/>You might have made the officer show his mark, kinda like in the movies. "LAPD Ma''am, we need to have a look into your trunk."</td>', 'I''d not have cropped the top of his head and the left of the flag. The picture might use some more colour, too.You might have made the officer show his mark, kinda like in the movies. "LAPD Ma''am, we need to have a look into your trunk."', '2004-11-24 12:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031341, 122313, 28141, '<td valign="top">It''s so blown out you can''t really see that it''s a sunrise.</td>', 'It''s so blown out you can''t really see that it''s a sunrise.', '2004-11-24 12:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031343, 123447, 19408, '<td valign="top">I love this picture! It would have been great if he was holding some weapons or something. Or maybe his crew behind him like destro and stormshadow. COBRAAAHH!</td>', 'I love this picture! It would have been great if he was holding some weapons or something. Or maybe his crew behind him like destro and stormshadow. COBRAAAHH!', '2004-11-24 12:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031344, 123469, 28141, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this fits in the theme...</td>', 'I''m not sure how this fits in the theme...', '2004-11-24 12:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031345, 122797, 27845, '<td valign="top">This picture shows but the persons'' backs. You might have tried catching some more faces. This is where people have to pay taxes, right? How about making them tax a camera?</td>', 'This picture shows but the persons'' backs. You might have tried catching some more faces. This is where people have to pay taxes, right? How about making them tax a camera?', '2004-11-24 12:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031347, 123333, 117, '<td valign="top">nice night shot I like it 9</td>', 'nice night shot I like it 9', '2004-11-24 12:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031348, 122379, 28141, '<td valign="top">The shot is kindof interesting, but you shouldn''t have to look to the title to know how it fits the theme.</td>', 'The shot is kindof interesting, but you shouldn''t have to look to the title to know how it fits the theme.', '2004-11-24 12:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031349, 123450, 27845, '<td valign="top">By chosing to capture her from below you wanted to show her dominant position. That''s good. I think if the light came from below, too, that would have emphasized this impression.</td>', 'By chosing to capture her from below you wanted to show her dominant position. That''s good. I think if the light came from below, too, that would have emphasized this impression.', '2004-11-24 12:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031351, 122790, 27845, '<td valign="top">This one would have worked better if there was a guard standing there. You know, like in Baywatch. The crop works fine for me. Perhaps some more saturation.</td>', 'This one would have worked better if there was a guard standing there. You know, like in Baywatch. The crop works fine for me. Perhaps some more saturation.', '2004-11-24 12:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031352, 123405, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. You might have put the figures closest at hand a bit more to the side. And adding some more (yes, you''d need another set of figures) would have made the idea of a corridor leading to the king&amp;queen even stronger. Nice idea though, how two figures can dominate a whole game.</td>', 'Nice idea. You might have put the figures closest at hand a bit more to the side. And adding some more (yes, you''d need another set of figures) would have made the idea of a corridor leading to the king&queen even stronger. Nice idea though, how two figures can dominate a whole game.', '2004-11-24 12:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031354, 123449, 27845, '<td valign="top">This is juist what it is. An accident. You might have taken a shot of an officer doing the records and talking to witnesses. The tree on the right is irritating. There are too many cars for the two that are concerned to come out well.</td>', 'This is juist what it is. An accident. You might have taken a shot of an officer doing the records and talking to witnesses. The tree on the right is irritating. There are too many cars for the two that are concerned to come out well.', '2004-11-24 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031356, 123360, 26827, '<td valign="top">Nice environmental portrait.  As is getting very common, a somewhat tenuous connection to the topic.  I think ashallower depth-of-field, blurring out the busy background just a bit, would highlight the women more.</td>', 'Nice environmental portrait.  As is getting very common, a somewhat tenuous connection to the topic.  I think ashallower depth-of-field, blurring out the busy background just a bit, would highlight the women more.', '2004-11-24 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031357, 123532, 27845, '<td valign="top">Very nice interpretation of authority. I never thought about the laws of nature. I know you couldn''t help that, but the light on the bottom on the right side doesn''t fit into the composition. I don''t like the dark backgound because the lens is dark too. But there''s no other way to show the laser, except if you used some smoke. You might have used a cigarette. I don''t want to encourage you to smoke, though!</td>', 'Very nice interpretation of authority. I never thought about the laws of nature. I know you couldn''t help that, but the light on the bottom on the right side doesn''t fit into the composition. I don''t like the dark backgound because the lens is dark too. But there''s no other way to show the laser, except if you used some smoke. You might have used a cigarette. I don''t want to encourage you to smoke, though!', '2004-11-24 12:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031358, 123333, 26827, '<td valign="top">The image is a bit too dark for my taste.  With the signs stacked like this, I don''t feel that they are blocking anything.  If it had just been two, great, this, not-so-great.</td>', 'The image is a bit too dark for my taste.  With the signs stacked like this, I don''t feel that they are blocking anything.  If it had just been two, great, this, not-so-great.', '2004-11-24 12:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031362, 122543, 27845, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures, great depth of field. You met the challenge, too. I feel a tighter crop from the left would have been better. Cropping a bit off the right might have made the words PROSECUTED and IMPRISONMENT come put better.</td>', 'Very nice textures, great depth of field. You met the challenge, too. I feel a tighter crop from the left would have been better. Cropping a bit off the right might have made the words PROSECUTED and IMPRISONMENT come put better.', '2004-11-24 12:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031364, 122681, 27845, '<td valign="top">You lost a lot of details by chosing such a smal file size. The referee doesn''t suggest too much authority, as he''s kneeling down. Usually they throne a bit over the players and put their nose into the air :)</td>', 'You lost a lot of details by chosing such a smal file size. The referee doesn''t suggest too much authority, as he''s kneeling down. Usually they throne a bit over the players and put their nose into the air :)', '2004-11-24 12:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031366, 122582, 26827, '<td valign="top">On the plus side, you''ve intelligently titled your work.  It is important to remember this a multi-cultural site, with many different viewpoints.  You have, which makes this shot more palatable to those diferent viewpoints.  It is a little soft on the text, but not processed enough to give it a "surreal" feel, going sharper, or more processed would improve, I think.  Compositionally, with the shadow, I lik it.  On the whole, a pretty good piece.</td>', 'On the plus side, you''ve intelligently titled your work.  It is important to remember this a multi-cultural site, with many different viewpoints.  You have, which makes this shot more palatable to those diferent viewpoints.  It is a little soft on the text, but not processed enough to give it a "surreal" feel, going sharper, or more processed would improve, I think.  Compositionally, with the shadow, I lik it.  On the whole, a pretty good piece.', '2004-11-24 12:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031368, 123395, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. You might have cropped the horse''s eyes away. Showing them makes me want to see the whole of its head. It distracts a bit from the main subject, which is of course the rider. I like the superiority in his face. Perhaps that''s just because of the moustache. I don''t want to hurt anyone, but did you notice that most dictators have mustaches?</td>', 'Nice DOF. You might have cropped the horse''s eyes away. Showing them makes me want to see the whole of its head. It distracts a bit from the main subject, which is of course the rider. I like the superiority in his face. Perhaps that''s just because of the moustache. I don''t want to hurt anyone, but did you notice that most dictators have mustaches?', '2004-11-24 12:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031371, 123500, 26827, '<td valign="top">Putting this shot onthe horizontal would be better.  The angle is just distracting.  Also, some shade over the lens to sut down on the lens flare would have been better.</td>', 'Putting this shot onthe horizontal would be better.  The angle is just distracting.  Also, some shade over the lens to sut down on the lens flare would have been better.', '2004-11-24 12:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
