(1031394, 122760, 27845, '<td valign="top">Very impressive. A soldier (symbol of authority) standing under a rocket launcher (language of authority during wars), wearing an MG (same as for r.l.). I''d say you match the challenge perfectly. The fence is annoying though, and I''d have liked some more details in his uniform.</td>', 'Very impressive. A soldier (symbol of authority) standing under a rocket launcher (language of authority during wars), wearing an MG (same as for r.l.). I''d say you match the challenge perfectly. The fence is annoying though, and I''d have liked some more details in his uniform.', '2004-11-24 12:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031398, 122790, 26827, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough about boats, I guess, to know what thsiis.  The slight off-vertical is not good.  Basically I like it.  Good silhouette, and interesting how the ocean is bright, but the sky is muted color.</td>', 'I don''t know enough about boats, I guess, to know what thsiis.  The slight off-vertical is not good.  Basically I like it.  Good silhouette, and interesting how the ocean is bright, but the sky is muted color.', '2004-11-24 12:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
