(1031410, 123453, 27845, '<td valign="top">Yeah, you damn pigeons! If ever I catch one of you sh**ting on my head... ;o)<br/>Okay, let''s talk serious. This statue definitely suggests authority, but the ''marks'' on his head make him look too ridiculous to be impressive. And what''s that blue spot? A star? That doesn''t fit in there.</td>', 'Yeah, you damn pigeons! If ever I catch one of you sh**ting on my head... ;o)Okay, let''s talk serious. This statue definitely suggests authority, but the ''marks'' on his head make him look too ridiculous to be impressive. And what''s that blue spot? A star? That doesn''t fit in there.', '2004-11-24 13:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031411, 123344, 26827, '<td valign="top">I had expected there to be more shots of stop signs.  Yours is my favorite of the bunch.    The color is pleasing, and the isolation and composition make the sign the important part.  Good take on it.</td>', 'I had expected there to be more shots of stop signs.  Yours is my favorite of the bunch.    The color is pleasing, and the isolation and composition make the sign the important part.  Good take on it.', '2004-11-24 13:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031415, 122425, 27845, '<td valign="top">Dear, it took me quite some time to get the meaning of this one. Nice idea, a large interpretation of authority, but that''s just fine. Perhaps a more yellowish sepia look would have added more to the idea of time passing than the black-brown. Nice lighting, the pendula should come out better if you had set it to a slower speed (yes I know it''s called allegro, but just for the setup.)</td>', 'Dear, it took me quite some time to get the meaning of this one. Nice idea, a large interpretation of authority, but that''s just fine. Perhaps a more yellowish sepia look would have added more to the idea of time passing than the black-brown. Nice lighting, the pendula should come out better if you had set it to a slower speed (yes I know it''s called allegro, but just for the setup.)', '2004-11-24 13:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031417, 123251, 26827, '<td valign="top">Looks a little out-of-focus.  Somewhat daring theme for this bunch.  Might have tried a more diffuse lighting to cut down on the highlights.</td>', 'Looks a little out-of-focus.  Somewhat daring theme for this bunch.  Might have tried a more diffuse lighting to cut down on the highlights.', '2004-11-24 13:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031419, 123317, 26827, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space.  Nice detail on the feathers.  As for topic, not great.</td>', 'Good use of negative space.  Nice detail on the feathers.  As for topic, not great.', '2004-11-24 13:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031421, 122419, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like that his soles are in the image. Looks like he was standing on my face. He should have put on different shoes, though.</td>', 'I like that his soles are in the image. Looks like he was standing on my face. He should have put on different shoes, though.', '2004-11-24 13:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031423, 123397, 27845, '<td valign="top">First, I don''t think so. Second, I don''t see the money very well. It''s just too dark. You might have set up a scenery where somebody''s paying an officer, corrupting him. That would have made your idea clearer.</td>', 'First, I don''t think so. Second, I don''t see the money very well. It''s just too dark. You might have set up a scenery where somebody''s paying an officer, corrupting him. That would have made your idea clearer.', '2004-11-24 13:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031429, 123055, 27845, '<td valign="top">Scary. I won''t argue with that guy. ''Yeah Kong, whatever you say, hehe...''<br/>Nice crop, the picture is slightly taken from below, emphasizing the gorilla''s majesty.</td>', 'Scary. I won''t argue with that guy. ''Yeah Kong, whatever you say, hehe...''Nice crop, the picture is slightly taken from below, emphasizing the gorilla''s majesty.', '2004-11-24 13:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
