(1031432, 123295, 27845, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark, I''d have liked to see the exression in his eyes. I don''t like that dude behind him, but I know it''s hard to get a good composition when everything''s changing all the time.</td>', 'A bit too dark, I''d have liked to see the exression in his eyes. I don''t like that dude behind him, but I know it''s hard to get a good composition when everything''s changing all the time.', '2004-11-24 13:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031438, 122582, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow effect. I''d prefer a lower angle. The ''(for some)'' in the title is not required. It just deminishes the firmness of your message.</td>', 'Nice shadow effect. I''d prefer a lower angle. The ''(for some)'' in the title is not required. It just deminishes the firmness of your message.', '2004-11-24 13:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031441, 122555, 27845, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this one''s great. Very clear colours, a simple message with an ironic comment in the title. I don''t know why, but the rotation''s nice, too. Perhaps, sometime, you can teach me why.<br/>I guess I can finally handle out a 10. Well done.</td>', 'Yeah, this one''s great. Very clear colours, a simple message with an ironic comment in the title. I don''t know why, but the rotation''s nice, too. Perhaps, sometime, you can teach me why.I guess I can finally handle out a 10. Well done.', '2004-11-24 13:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031445, 123454, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Why not simply use a symbol of authority instead of an example. I like that. The duotone works well with the statue, it emphasizes the texture and the shadows.</td>', 'Nice idea. Why not simply use a symbol of authority instead of an example. I like that. The duotone works well with the statue, it emphasizes the texture and the shadows.', '2004-11-24 13:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031454, 123299, 18799, '<td valign="top">Really powerful image.  I don''t like looking at it, but that makes it good and effective.  As for the technical merits, I think it could have used some levels/contrast adjustments as it looks a little muddy to me.   9</td>', 'Really powerful image.  I don''t like looking at it, but that makes it good and effective.  As for the technical merits, I think it could have used some levels/contrast adjustments as it looks a little muddy to me.   9', '2004-11-24 13:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031455, 123315, 27845, '<td valign="top">Ooh, that''s a good reason :) I like that. Children love to see how much authority they have on others. She looks really annoyed. The way she folds her arms adds to that. Nice idea, but I''d have liked her shirt to be brighter.</td>', 'Ooh, that''s a good reason :) I like that. Children love to see how much authority they have on others. She looks really annoyed. The way she folds her arms adds to that. Nice idea, but I''d have liked her shirt to be brighter.', '2004-11-24 13:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031456, 123253, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m not too keen on the blurred border.</td>', 'I''m not too keen on the blurred border.', '2004-11-24 13:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031457, 122538, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice Resident Evil feeling in this one. But I can''t see the link to the challenge topic. Okay, let''s pretend there was one. The small width and height destroy many of the details which clearly are important to your composition. I''d have liked to see this one a bit bigger.</td>', 'Nice Resident Evil feeling in this one. But I can''t see the link to the challenge topic. Okay, let''s pretend there was one. The small width and height destroy many of the details which clearly are important to your composition. I''d have liked to see this one a bit bigger.', '2004-11-24 13:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031458, 122419, 18799, '<td valign="top">This was my thought, but didn''t pull it off and enter.  I think it''s a good shot, but IMO, it''s too close.  My vision is a couple feet farther out and then up.  7</td>', 'This was my thought, but didn''t pull it off and enter.  I think it''s a good shot, but IMO, it''s too close.  My vision is a couple feet farther out and then up.  7', '2004-11-24 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031467, 123299, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''d have given it a different title. But that''s not so important. The composition is nice, I feel like the watcher of that scenery, which makes me feel unconfortable, and that''s the best part of this picture. The woman crouches in a corner, clearly tries to protect herself, and the way the man holds the belt clearly shows his intentions.<br/>A bit mor light would have made the details come out nicer. The guy''s hand is either too blurred or not blurred enough. The crop is perfect. You might have taken te picture in the other side of the corridor. Having the doorknob in it would have brought in an additional element: a possibility (the only one) to get away.</td>', 'I''d have given it a different title. But that''s not so important. The composition is nice, I feel like the watcher of that scenery, which makes me feel unconfortable, and that''s the best part of this picture. The woman crouches in a corner, clearly tries to protect herself, and the way the man holds the belt clearly shows his intentions.A bit mor light would have made the details come out nicer. The guy''s hand is either too blurred or not blurred enough. The crop is perfect. You might have taken te picture in the other side of the corridor. Having the doorknob in it would have brought in an additional element: a possibility (the only one) to get away.', '2004-11-24 13:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031472, 123381, 27845, '<td valign="top">What the...? When Government...? Sorry? I don''t get it.</td>', 'What the...? When Government...? Sorry? I don''t get it.', '2004-11-24 13:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031477, 123289, 27845, '<td valign="top">Poor fluffy. Authority''s hard, but it''s just for his best. Nice colours. I like the detail of his plate.</td>', 'Poor fluffy. Authority''s hard, but it''s just for his best. Nice colours. I like the detail of his plate.', '2004-11-24 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031479, 123510, 27845, '<td valign="top">You should have used a blackbord as background. But she does look severe. I know some people that would like to get a good beating ;)</td>', 'You should have used a blackbord as background. But she does look severe. I know some people that would like to get a good beating ;)', '2004-11-24 13:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
