(1031911, 123523, 12792, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and good thought procecss... Not sure if the focus was to be blured or not, but not a big issue for me in this case.</td>', 'Very nice image and good thought procecss... Not sure if the focus was to be blured or not, but not a big issue for me in this case.', '2004-11-24 18:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
