(1031916, 123510, 12792, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the image overall is washed out and without any "edge".  Some assertiveness, or edginess would be great for this subject as it''s really set the view back on his/r chair.  Good luck...</td>', 'Good idea, but the image overall is washed out and without any "edge".  Some assertiveness, or edginess would be great for this subject as it''s really set the view back on his/r chair.  Good luck...', '2004-11-24 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031921, 122285, 12792, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that I''m at a loss here.  I''m unable to find the subject let alone the raltionship to the subject of the challenge.  I am sorry... 2   If you read this and would like to send me a message to help me understand, please do.</td>', 'I have to admit that I''m at a loss here.  I''m unable to find the subject let alone the raltionship to the subject of the challenge.  I am sorry... 2   If you read this and would like to send me a message to help me understand, please do.', '2004-11-24 18:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031923, 123253, 12792, '<td valign="top">I''d have rated this subject a 5 (not an unusal subject), but your approach was a lot of fun and quite original.  Congrats on it!  Bump</td>', 'I''d have rated this subject a 5 (not an unusal subject), but your approach was a lot of fun and quite original.  Congrats on it!  Bump', '2004-11-24 18:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031925, 123405, 12792, '<td valign="top">Very original... congrats!</td>', 'Very original... congrats!', '2004-11-24 19:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031928, 123445, 12792, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the overall image... I would have preferred  that you corrected the verticals.  By the way in doing so, I think the composition would have been helped too, by reducing some of the featureless dark areas in the upper left quadrant of the image.  Nice effort.  5</td>', 'I like the idea and the overall image... I would have preferred  that you corrected the verticals.  By the way in doing so, I think the composition would have been helped too, by reducing some of the featureless dark areas in the upper left quadrant of the image.  Nice effort.  5', '2004-11-24 19:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
