(1031975, 123237, 2741, '<td valign="top">This fits well. Would not be surprised to see this ribbon in the top 3. Best idea for the challenge. Good Luck.</td>', 'This fits well. Would not be surprised to see this ribbon in the top 3. Best idea for the challenge. Good Luck.', '2004-11-24 20:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031977, 123412, 2741, '<td valign="top">Marvin is my favorite.  I like the prop you used. Good idea.   Good Luck.</td>', 'Marvin is my favorite.  I like the prop you used. Good idea.   Good Luck.', '2004-11-24 20:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031980, 123528, 2741, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. I like that shadow. Unique perspective.</td>', 'This is interesting. I like that shadow. Unique perspective.', '2004-11-24 20:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031983, 123500, 19790, '<td valign="top">but it''s green in his direction<br/>and it''s a right hand turn...</td>', 'but it''s green in his directionand it''s a right hand turn...', '2004-11-24 20:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031987, 123478, 2741, '<td valign="top">This is a very technically sound photo. Lighting is perfect.  The only thing I would have done was cropped a little more on the left side.  There is more space from the fingers to the edge on that side.  Otherwise....  strong entry and good technique.   8</td>', 'This is a very technically sound photo. Lighting is perfect.  The only thing I would have done was cropped a little more on the left side.  There is more space from the fingers to the edge on that side.  Otherwise....  strong entry and good technique.   8', '2004-11-24 20:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031990, 123299, 2741, '<td valign="top">Very strong message here. I like it.  Only thing I would have done was brought up the brightness just a tad on the woman. Not much though... you still want to keep the ''dark'' mood in there.   Very good choice on focusing sharp on the woman.    8</td>', 'Very strong message here. I like it.  Only thing I would have done was brought up the brightness just a tad on the woman. Not much though... you still want to keep the ''dark'' mood in there.   Very good choice on focusing sharp on the woman.    8', '2004-11-24 20:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031993, 123530, 2741, '<td valign="top">I like the angle. Unique. And colors are vibrant.  Good job, and good luck.</td>', 'I like the angle. Unique. And colors are vibrant.  Good job, and good luck.', '2004-11-24 20:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031994, 122905, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like this shot - the angle and arrangement particularly. Also, the ''Sister'' has done a great job. <br/>But I do feel that instead of the cigarettes in the open and the other hands with fingers crossed, that it would work better if they were hiding the cigarettes with that hand. <br/>The way it is now, it looks a bit too staged or a few frames missing somewhere, a bit unnatural I mean.</td>', 'I like this shot - the angle and arrangement particularly. Also, the ''Sister'' has done a great job. But I do feel that instead of the cigarettes in the open and the other hands with fingers crossed, that it would work better if they were hiding the cigarettes with that hand. The way it is now, it looks a bit too staged or a few frames missing somewhere, a bit unnatural I mean.', '2004-11-24 20:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031996, 122419, 2741, '<td valign="top">Good Angle on this. Definitely an imposing sense of authority here.  I think this might have been better in Black and White. Also...  more shoe showing on the left side makes it seem uneven. Otherwise good entry. I give this a 7</td>', 'Good Angle on this. Definitely an imposing sense of authority here.  I think this might have been better in Black and White. Also...  more shoe showing on the left side makes it seem uneven. Otherwise good entry. I give this a 7', '2004-11-24 20:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1031997, 123346, 22556, '<td valign="top">does basic editing meet this pics???</td>', 'does basic editing meet this pics???', '2004-11-24 20:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032000, 123507, 2741, '<td valign="top">People may slam you for the effect, but I like it.  Definitely stands out from the rest of the photos. I give this a 7 based on my personal taste for certain types of photographs. Good Job.</td>', 'People may slam you for the effect, but I like it.  Definitely stands out from the rest of the photos. I give this a 7 based on my personal taste for certain types of photographs. Good Job.', '2004-11-24 20:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032001, 123214, 2741, '<td valign="top">Very Amusing. I like this shot. Just goes to show you how much of a point they are trying to make. And lets not forget... people will still try to smuggle stuff after reading this. LOL.<br/>I give this a 7.</td>', 'Very Amusing. I like this shot. Just goes to show you how much of a point they are trying to make. And lets not forget... people will still try to smuggle stuff after reading this. LOL.I give this a 7.', '2004-11-24 20:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032009, 123363, 29513, '<td valign="top">Wow, did you make her mad just to get this shot?  I like how the composition makes her seem in-my-face.</td>', 'Wow, did you make her mad just to get this shot?  I like how the composition makes her seem in-my-face.', '2004-11-24 20:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032011, 123295, 10432, '<td valign="top">Good subject for the challenge.  Reasonable composition.  Would be improved if the guy behind the ref was not there.  Also, the image is a bit too dark and focus is a bit soft on the refs face.  BOL</td>', 'Good subject for the challenge.  Reasonable composition.  Would be improved if the guy behind the ref was not there.  Also, the image is a bit too dark and focus is a bit soft on the refs face.  BOL', '2004-11-24 20:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032013, 123539, 29513, '<td valign="top">I have never noticed the coincidence of this game to the branches of the United States government.  Executive, Legislative, Judicial.  Which one is which, do you think?  Nice job.</td>', 'I have never noticed the coincidence of this game to the branches of the United States government.  Executive, Legislative, Judicial.  Which one is which, do you think?  Nice job.', '2004-11-24 20:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032016, 123498, 10432, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - but I''m not sure that this sepia tone works.  It''s just not flattering - makes the baby look a bit jaundiced.  Maybe straight b&amp;w would be better.  Also, would be improved if the baby''s face did not have the hot spots.</td>', 'Nice capture - but I''m not sure that this sepia tone works.  It''s just not flattering - makes the baby look a bit jaundiced.  Maybe straight b&w would be better.  Also, would be improved if the baby''s face did not have the hot spots.', '2004-11-24 20:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
