(1032110, 123344, 29187, '<td valign="top">Whites aren''t white, kinda boring</td>', 'Whites aren''t white, kinda boring', '2004-11-24 23:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032113, 123435, 29187, '<td valign="top">Sorry....don''t see this as "the press", also don''t see any of these religions as Tyranny, Hitler was a Tyrant, Mussolini was a Tyrant, God is not.</td>', 'Sorry....don''t see this as "the press", also don''t see any of these religions as Tyranny, Hitler was a Tyrant, Mussolini was a Tyrant, God is not.', '2004-11-24 23:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032114, 123217, 29187, '<td valign="top">Looks more of a subject of fear or intimidation, not authority</td>', 'Looks more of a subject of fear or intimidation, not authority', '2004-11-24 23:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032118, 123483, 29187, '<td valign="top">Title ruins the shot.  It''s ot a license to kill, a police officer can not just walk around and shoot &amp; kill people just because he has a badge.  You want the title license to kill perhaps you should have posted a photo of a hunting license, that''s a license to kill.  The photo represents authority, the title doesn''t -1 for the title, 2 for the quality of the shot, badge is slightly out of focus, the shotgun shell should have been placed in the back not in the forefront, especially since you focused on the the badge, the blurry shotgun shell is distracting, takes all of the attention -1 + 2 = 1</td>', 'Title ruins the shot.  It''s ot a license to kill, a police officer can not just walk around and shoot & kill people just because he has a badge.  You want the title license to kill perhaps you should have posted a photo of a hunting license, that''s a license to kill.  The photo represents authority, the title doesn''t -1 for the title, 2 for the quality of the shot, badge is slightly out of focus, the shotgun shell should have been placed in the back not in the forefront, especially since you focused on the the badge, the blurry shotgun shell is distracting, takes all of the attention -1 + 2 = 1', '2004-11-24 23:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032119, 122532, 29187, '<td valign="top">Finally a decent photo</td>', 'Finally a decent photo', '2004-11-24 23:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032137, 123338, 29309, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the entire spider in the depth of feild, currently to much of the web at the top left is in focus, and the impact would be greater if the spider was in complete focus</td>', 'I would like to see the entire spider in the depth of feild, currently to much of the web at the top left is in focus, and the impact would be greater if the spider was in complete focus', '2004-11-24 23:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032138, 123539, 29309, '<td valign="top">very clever</td>', 'very clever', '2004-11-24 23:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032140, 123000, 29309, '<td valign="top">a tighter crop, so we could read the signs might have been nice</td>', 'a tighter crop, so we could read the signs might have been nice', '2004-11-24 23:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032162, 123507, 22384, '<td valign="top">Creative, edgy, and risky. I like that in a photo. It works for me.</td>', 'Creative, edgy, and risky. I like that in a photo. It works for me.', '2004-11-24 23:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032168, 123509, 22384, '<td valign="top">The framing of this photo truly make me feel as if I have walked up to this beach and been stopped cold in my tracks. The harsh light on the sign emphasizes its harsh message. The like the use of space and the only shadow I can really see being the shadow of the sign, hiniting at what lies behind it perhaps? The fact that the sign is slightly angles away, whether intentional by the artist or not,  makes me almost feel as though I have to look around it to read it better. This photo works well for me.</td>', 'The framing of this photo truly make me feel as if I have walked up to this beach and been stopped cold in my tracks. The harsh light on the sign emphasizes its harsh message. The like the use of space and the only shadow I can really see being the shadow of the sign, hiniting at what lies behind it perhaps? The fact that the sign is slightly angles away, whether intentional by the artist or not,  makes me almost feel as though I have to look around it to read it better. This photo works well for me.', '2004-11-24 23:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032173, 123033, 22384, '<td valign="top">Gotta love a sense of humor, and oh, that threatening ruler, blurred in movement. I am not sure of the map image, maybe it is to give a feel of the classroom or to help us set this in the United States. I love the angle,  the point of view, and that hilarious expression on the nuns face. As a troublemaker, I have been on the receiving end of that expression many, many times. You absolutely nailed this challenge. I feel like I am a little kid again...in trouble again. Masterful.</td>', 'Gotta love a sense of humor, and oh, that threatening ruler, blurred in movement. I am not sure of the map image, maybe it is to give a feel of the classroom or to help us set this in the United States. I love the angle,  the point of view, and that hilarious expression on the nuns face. As a troublemaker, I have been on the receiving end of that expression many, many times. You absolutely nailed this challenge. I feel like I am a little kid again...in trouble again. Masterful.', '2004-11-24 23:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032178, 122379, 22384, '<td valign="top">It is the point of view that allows this to meet the challenge for me. Interesting take. I gotta admire a risk taker.</td>', 'It is the point of view that allows this to meet the challenge for me. Interesting take. I gotta admire a risk taker.', '2004-11-24 23:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032186, 123491, 22384, '<td valign="top">Ah, the reflection of the light and your title allow me to ponder the flipside of Santa. That threatening list... Nice use of golds and yellows to create a Christmassy feel. Great framing and use of light. Captivating, thought-provoking image. Nicely done. I feel a creative mind with a bit of an edge at work here. I have to admit, I like it.</td>', 'Ah, the reflection of the light and your title allow me to ponder the flipside of Santa. That threatening list... Nice use of golds and yellows to create a Christmassy feel. Great framing and use of light. Captivating, thought-provoking image. Nicely done. I feel a creative mind with a bit of an edge at work here. I have to admit, I like it.', '2004-11-25 00:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032187, 123539, 18799, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out what this is, sorry</td>', 'I can''t figure out what this is, sorry', '2004-11-25 00:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032188, 123289, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great angle, nice job by revealing a hint of that bandaged foot. Those collars, although essential to healing, seem horrific to me. What those poor dogs must think when one of them is slapped on. Nice job with a photo that nails the challenge.</td>', 'Great angle, nice job by revealing a hint of that bandaged foot. Those collars, although essential to healing, seem horrific to me. What those poor dogs must think when one of them is slapped on. Nice job with a photo that nails the challenge.', '2004-11-25 00:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032190, 123336, 22384, '<td valign="top">I am not sure here what White man''s burden means. Nice use of space and line. The photo does make me want to take a step back and get out of the way. The artist''s choice of angle and point of view works very well. Sorry I don''t get the White man''s burden part. It is probably obvious. Is it that we must bear the burden of all the killing that has been done by white men? Let me know if you get a chance. Nonetheless, the photo carries a certain energy and intensity that certainly works very well for this challenge.</td>', 'I am not sure here what White man''s burden means. Nice use of space and line. The photo does make me want to take a step back and get out of the way. The artist''s choice of angle and point of view works very well. Sorry I don''t get the White man''s burden part. It is probably obvious. Is it that we must bear the burden of all the killing that has been done by white men? Let me know if you get a chance. Nonetheless, the photo carries a certain energy and intensity that certainly works very well for this challenge.', '2004-11-25 00:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032193, 122406, 24138, '<td valign="top">i think you cut out too much of the "pack" in this shot. and the empty space on the left hand side doesn''t help you out much either. 4.</td>', 'i think you cut out too much of the "pack" in this shot. and the empty space on the left hand side doesn''t help you out much either. 4.', '2004-11-25 00:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032195, 123445, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color, but perhaps it is a bit too pleasant for your subject matter. The contrast of the lines of the building and the spokes and spines of the shrubbery, is striking. Interesting framing, angle, and point of view.</td>', 'Nice use of color, but perhaps it is a bit too pleasant for your subject matter. The contrast of the lines of the building and the spokes and spines of the shrubbery, is striking. Interesting framing, angle, and point of view.', '2004-11-25 00:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032196, 123234, 24138, '<td valign="top">his face is a lil overblown... maybe a polarizer woulda helpd out some. other than lacking some sharpness, this photo is great. 5.</td>', 'his face is a lil overblown... maybe a polarizer woulda helpd out some. other than lacking some sharpness, this photo is great. 5.', '2004-11-25 00:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032197, 123439, 24138, '<td valign="top">lights are kinda blown out. a shorter exposure might have made the scene more intimate and a little less distracting. good composition though... 4.</td>', 'lights are kinda blown out. a shorter exposure might have made the scene more intimate and a little less distracting. good composition though... 4.', '2004-11-25 00:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032198, 122681, 24138, '<td valign="top">looks like he''s picking up the flag? lol</td>', 'looks like he''s picking up the flag? lol', '2004-11-25 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032199, 122413, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like this idea. The open space at the bottom of the photo is distracitng. I would like to see you pull in tighter, and swing around more to full front, not square on full but to give the image a more solid feel. I think you should either square it up a bit, or completely come in from the side with the words MY AUTHORITY filling the frame and every other word softly and fading away.</td>', 'I like this idea. The open space at the bottom of the photo is distracitng. I would like to see you pull in tighter, and swing around more to full front, not square on full but to give the image a more solid feel. I think you should either square it up a bit, or completely come in from the side with the words MY AUTHORITY filling the frame and every other word softly and fading away.', '2004-11-25 00:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032203, 123299, 22384, '<td valign="top">The angle and point of view certainly capture the feeling of the cowering woman. As a woman, I am uncomfortable staring down at the woman. I am sure that was intended. Since you are using it as a key element, I want to see the belt image tight and crisp. The woman should be even more out of focus because her abuser doesn''t empathize with her pain. Since you are putting me in the position of abuser by your choice of point of view, I should see the woman as nonhuman as her abuser would. Daring photo. I appreciate your courage and your willingness to take a risk.</td>', 'The angle and point of view certainly capture the feeling of the cowering woman. As a woman, I am uncomfortable staring down at the woman. I am sure that was intended. Since you are using it as a key element, I want to see the belt image tight and crisp. The woman should be even more out of focus because her abuser doesn''t empathize with her pain. Since you are putting me in the position of abuser by your choice of point of view, I should see the woman as nonhuman as her abuser would. Daring photo. I appreciate your courage and your willingness to take a risk.', '2004-11-25 00:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032206, 122681, 22384, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t work for me because of the position you have put the ref in. He seems to be cowering. Maybe that was intended. I think it would be more powerful to have him facing down a player, throwing down the flag, or marking off the penalty. It sort of looks like he is a lady daintily picking up a hankie. Good use of color and crisp image. The placement of the subject within the frame is nicely done, also.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t work for me because of the position you have put the ref in. He seems to be cowering. Maybe that was intended. I think it would be more powerful to have him facing down a player, throwing down the flag, or marking off the penalty. It sort of looks like he is a lady daintily picking up a hankie. Good use of color and crisp image. The placement of the subject within the frame is nicely done, also.', '2004-11-25 00:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032209, 123449, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you shot this from almost the same point of view as another photographer and that you included him in your frame. I get the message that the media are the authority because they have the power of the slant of the story and the angle of the image. Am I right?</td>', 'Interesting that you shot this from almost the same point of view as another photographer and that you included him in your frame. I get the message that the media are the authority because they have the power of the slant of the story and the angle of the image. Am I right?', '2004-11-25 00:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032210, 123453, 24138, '<td valign="top">great concept... i woulda used a little less negative space though... seems kinda distracting to me. just a though ;) 5</td>', 'great concept... i woulda used a little less negative space though... seems kinda distracting to me. just a though ;) 5', '2004-11-25 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032211, 123510, 22384, '<td valign="top">This image looks staight out of a low-budget S&amp;M porno. Your subject looks a little frightened if you ask me. Angle, framing, and stark use of muted colors enhance the severity of the image. Daring and edgy. If my interpretation is correct, the undertones were intended.</td>', 'This image looks staight out of a low-budget S&M porno. Your subject looks a little frightened if you ask me. Angle, framing, and stark use of muted colors enhance the severity of the image. Daring and edgy. If my interpretation is correct, the undertones were intended.', '2004-11-25 00:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032213, 123214, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great job of letting this image fill the frame. Centering it smack dab in the middle works well in this instance, even though it violates the first rule of compostion. The stark red and white really do shout out the message.</td>', 'Great job of letting this image fill the frame. Centering it smack dab in the middle works well in this instance, even though it violates the first rule of compostion. The stark red and white really do shout out the message.', '2004-11-25 00:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032217, 123065, 22384, '<td valign="top">Very funny. I like your humor. The colors seem drab and faded with the light source working against the image rather than enhancing it. Fun idea, though.</td>', 'Very funny. I like your humor. The colors seem drab and faded with the light source working against the image rather than enhancing it. Fun idea, though.', '2004-11-25 00:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032219, 122760, 24138, '<td valign="top">good composition but the soldier doesn''t seem to convey authority as well as he might have under more tense situations... 5</td>', 'good composition but the soldier doesn''t seem to convey authority as well as he might have under more tense situations... 5', '2004-11-25 00:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032220, 123314, 22384, '<td valign="top">Yes, this certainly meets the challenge. Great choice to use black and white. The stance, expression, and certainly the uniform of your subject, along with the words behind him, work very well for me.</td>', 'Yes, this certainly meets the challenge. Great choice to use black and white. The stance, expression, and certainly the uniform of your subject, along with the words behind him, work very well for me.', '2004-11-25 00:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032225, 122658, 24138, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot. I really like the composition and the bright, borderline overblown highlights. great stuff.</td>', 'wonderful shot. I really like the composition and the bright, borderline overblown highlights. great stuff.', '2004-11-25 00:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032230, 123501, 24138, '<td valign="top">we live by it... but you''re adjusting it... somewhat contradictory... no?</td>', 'we live by it... but you''re adjusting it... somewhat contradictory... no?', '2004-11-25 00:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032231, 123513, 24138, '<td valign="top">campbell''s bio... i feel your pain!</td>', 'campbell''s bio... i feel your pain!', '2004-11-25 00:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032255, 123384, 29168, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop around just the coach and the player would have carried this off much better. Without your title, the coach is barely noticble this way. Now if you could have been right down there on the court with a narow aperture... (I jest! :)</td>', 'I think a tighter crop around just the coach and the player would have carried this off much better. Without your title, the coach is barely noticble this way. Now if you could have been right down there on the court with a narow aperture... (I jest! :)', '2004-11-25 01:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032263, 123507, 326, '<td valign="top">This is really cool! Nice work.</td>', 'This is really cool! Nice work.', '2004-11-25 02:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032265, 123531, 326, '<td valign="top">This is really funny! Nice job.</td>', 'This is really funny! Nice job.', '2004-11-25 02:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032267, 122658, 22384, '<td valign="top">Oh, it took me a second to get it. Great idea. At first it looked like some sort of train moving off the the screen. The image creates movement. I like the framing and the reflection.</td>', 'Oh, it took me a second to get it. Great idea. At first it looked like some sort of train moving off the the screen. The image creates movement. I like the framing and the reflection.', '2004-11-25 02:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032270, 123538, 22384, '<td valign="top">Man, I see this image too often in Northern Nevada. Nice use of color and interesting placement within the frame. A real cow in the shot somewhere would have been interesting.</td>', 'Man, I see this image too often in Northern Nevada. Nice use of color and interesting placement within the frame. A real cow in the shot somewhere would have been interesting.', '2004-11-25 02:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032272, 123024, 326, '<td valign="top">Not sure what my comment should be...lol Interesting image :)</td>', 'Not sure what my comment should be...lol Interesting image :)', '2004-11-25 02:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032273, 122905, 22384, '<td valign="top">What is it with nuns, rulers, and authority? Seriously, great subtle images in this shot. I find it interesting that we are looking down on the nun. This shot is too well set up for that to be a mistake. I am curious about why you chose that particular angle and point of view.</td>', 'What is it with nuns, rulers, and authority? Seriously, great subtle images in this shot. I find it interesting that we are looking down on the nun. This shot is too well set up for that to be a mistake. I am curious about why you chose that particular angle and point of view.', '2004-11-25 02:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032274, 123405, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The use of color and the framing/composition work very well in this photo. I like the soft focus on the pawns and the crisp focus on the King and Queen.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The use of color and the framing/composition work very well in this photo. I like the soft focus on the pawns and the crisp focus on the King and Queen.', '2004-11-25 02:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032276, 123443, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great concept and clever title. The image rings false in that the clothes are too clean and the tears in the shirt too fresh. Pay attention to those details so that your work transcends and becomes real, not staged. Again, great premise, nice use of light and shadow.</td>', 'Great concept and clever title. The image rings false in that the clothes are too clean and the tears in the shirt too fresh. Pay attention to those details so that your work transcends and becomes real, not staged. Again, great premise, nice use of light and shadow.', '2004-11-25 02:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032279, 123528, 22384, '<td valign="top">Creative and risky. Fun idea to play around with light and shadow and the placement of your subject within the frame. Brilliant framing. Kudos to you for guts and daring since this tends to be a very traditional and narrowly focused forum. Keep pushing that edge and kicking at the boundries and maybe we will get these people thinking in terms of artistic merit and something marvelous may come of it.</td>', 'Creative and risky. Fun idea to play around with light and shadow and the placement of your subject within the frame. Brilliant framing. Kudos to you for guts and daring since this tends to be a very traditional and narrowly focused forum. Keep pushing that edge and kicking at the boundries and maybe we will get these people thinking in terms of artistic merit and something marvelous may come of it.', '2004-11-25 02:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032283, 122953, 22384, '<td valign="top">I am so sorry, but I don''t get it. Please feel free to send a message and explain it to me. Is there some homoerotic imagery that I am missing, or maybe a subtle symbol I am overlooking?</td>', 'I am so sorry, but I don''t get it. Please feel free to send a message and explain it to me. Is there some homoerotic imagery that I am missing, or maybe a subtle symbol I am overlooking?', '2004-11-25 02:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032284, 123375, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Great contrast in the textures of the part of your iamge that is in focus. This almost works for me, but not quite. I am not sure why, but I think may be because Dictionary is cut off at Dict, and that is the word I see. It blocks the image of dictionary from coming through for me. Perhaps a different cropping would work more effectively.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Great contrast in the textures of the part of your iamge that is in focus. This almost works for me, but not quite. I am not sure why, but I think may be because Dictionary is cut off at Dict, and that is the word I see. It blocks the image of dictionary from coming through for me. Perhaps a different cropping would work more effectively.', '2004-11-25 02:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032324, 123299, 29241, '<td valign="top">Powerful image</td>', 'Powerful image', '2004-11-25 04:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032332, 123028, 23394, '<td valign="top">while this is an interesting take on the challenge, the execution could use a little work.  the focus falls short of the subjects and the dof is too tight.  i don''t know if that was your intention, but it makes it hard to really get into the image.</td>', 'while this is an interesting take on the challenge, the execution could use a little work.  the focus falls short of the subjects and the dof is too tight.  i don''t know if that was your intention, but it makes it hard to really get into the image.', '2004-11-25 05:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032335, 123490, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge, showing the result of authority being applied, as opposed to authority itself.  the expression is suitable.  i wonder if the image would be stronger if cropped into to just the hand and eyes--if you''re going to go that route, why not go all the way?</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge, showing the result of authority being applied, as opposed to authority itself.  the expression is suitable.  i wonder if the image would be stronger if cropped into to just the hand and eyes--if you''re going to go that route, why not go all the way?', '2004-11-25 05:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032337, 122843, 23394, '<td valign="top">if your camera can use one, i would highly recommend a circular polarizing filter.  it lets you take these images without having to blow out the sky.  i bet you got a lot of other interesting shots while you were out there!</td>', 'if your camera can use one, i would highly recommend a circular polarizing filter.  it lets you take these images without having to blow out the sky.  i bet you got a lot of other interesting shots while you were out there!', '2004-11-25 05:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032339, 123341, 23394, '<td valign="top">cute doggy, nice take on the challenge.  if that is your hand, i''ll bet this was not an easy shot to take...</td>', 'cute doggy, nice take on the challenge.  if that is your hand, i''ll bet this was not an easy shot to take...', '2004-11-25 05:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032341, 123234, 23394, '<td valign="top">the lighting and colors just do not appeal to me in this image.  i can appreciate the focus and dof, but am having a hard time getting past the orange hues.</td>', 'the lighting and colors just do not appeal to me in this image.  i can appreciate the focus and dof, but am having a hard time getting past the orange hues.', '2004-11-25 05:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032342, 123375, 27431, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, but what''s with the spots?</td>', 'Nice macro, but what''s with the spots?', '2004-11-25 05:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032343, 122313, 27431, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it was your intent, but it seems a bit blown out to me.</td>', 'I don''t know if it was your intent, but it seems a bit blown out to me.', '2004-11-25 05:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032344, 123453, 14089, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite tell what''s in his hand, it would be funny if it was a T.V. Remote though.</td>', 'I can''t quite tell what''s in his hand, it would be funny if it was a T.V. Remote though.', '2004-11-25 05:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032345, 123512, 27431, '<td valign="top">Interesting text in the contract...</td>', 'Interesting text in the contract...', '2004-11-25 05:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032346, 122313, 14089, '<td valign="top">Extremely overexposed.</td>', 'Extremely overexposed.', '2004-11-25 05:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032348, 123433, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i appreciate your take on the challenge, i think the execution could use some work.  first, even though i am unfamiliar with Psalm 91, i am finding nothing in the text you''ve provided that speaks to authority.  it is almost as if you simply opened up a Bible and snapped a shot.  second, it could have been made more interesting if you had chosen a Bible that used multiple fonts and font styles (realizing, of course, that not everyone has access to lots of Bibles).  the lighting and focus are fine, it''s just the content that you''ve provided isn''t the most dynamic.</td>', 'while i appreciate your take on the challenge, i think the execution could use some work.  first, even though i am unfamiliar with Psalm 91, i am finding nothing in the text you''ve provided that speaks to authority.  it is almost as if you simply opened up a Bible and snapped a shot.  second, it could have been made more interesting if you had chosen a Bible that used multiple fonts and font styles (realizing, of course, that not everyone has access to lots of Bibles).  the lighting and focus are fine, it''s just the content that you''ve provided isn''t the most dynamic.', '2004-11-25 05:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1032349, 123164, 23394, '<td valign="top">something seems off on the coloring.  i''m seeing blue artifacts on and around the sculpture.  this is an interesting angle, and the sky is pretty wild.</td>', 'something seems off on the coloring.  i''m seeing blue artifacts on and around the sculpture.  this is an interesting angle, and the sky is pretty wild.', '2004-11-25 05:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
