(1033050, 123530, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... is that a hospital.... is MAYO an acronym for something ?? Otherwise I''m not really getting the challenge link here. I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and a 6 for an interesting perspective.</td>', 'Hmmm... is that a hospital.... is MAYO an acronym for something ?? Otherwise I''m not really getting the challenge link here. I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and a 6 for an interesting perspective.', '2004-11-26 00:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
