(1033193, 123318, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i can get what you''re shooting for, i think the execution could be a little stronger.  if you had rotated the badge another 10-15 cw, leaving the lighting the same, i think it would be much more dynamic.  as is, it looks like a badge, laying on its side.<br/> <br/>[not that it matters to me from a voting standpoint, i think the title could use a little work as well.]</td>', 'while i can get what you''re shooting for, i think the execution could be a little stronger.  if you had rotated the badge another 10-15 cw, leaving the lighting the same, i think it would be much more dynamic.  as is, it looks like a badge, laying on its side. [not that it matters to me from a voting standpoint, i think the title could use a little work as well.]', '2004-11-26 05:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033195, 123442, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know how you compressed this, but you have got some serious artifacting going on...wow!  yikes.  kinda hard to get past it.  <br/> <br/>ok, better now.  interesting choice of a symbol of authority.  maybe in a perfect world, they would be.  but, then again, in a perfect world, we probably wouldn''t need them...</td>', 'i don''t know how you compressed this, but you have got some serious artifacting going on...wow!  yikes.  kinda hard to get past it.   ok, better now.  interesting choice of a symbol of authority.  maybe in a perfect world, they would be.  but, then again, in a perfect world, we probably wouldn''t need them...', '2004-11-26 05:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033198, 122543, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is one of the more interesting interpretations of the challenge.  i think it would be much more powerful with a deeper depth of field, as well as if you''d shifted the focus a little more towards the sign.  good luck!</td>', 'this is one of the more interesting interpretations of the challenge.  i think it would be much more powerful with a deeper depth of field, as well as if you''d shifted the focus a little more towards the sign.  good luck!', '2004-11-26 05:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033201, 123397, 23394, '<td valign="top">not quite sure what to make of this image.  i understand the logic of the title, but not the symbol of the candle.  without the title, i would not really consider this an image of authority.  don''t know if you used a tripod or not, but i think the coins could be a bit sharper.  interesting colors produced by the candle light.  this might just be a case of the right image in the wrong challenge...</td>', 'not quite sure what to make of this image.  i understand the logic of the title, but not the symbol of the candle.  without the title, i would not really consider this an image of authority.  don''t know if you used a tripod or not, but i think the coins could be a bit sharper.  interesting colors produced by the candle light.  this might just be a case of the right image in the wrong challenge...', '2004-11-26 05:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033202, 123016, 23394, '<td valign="top">as far as meeting the challenge (signs all around us, telling us what to do), you have done that.  i think it would by a more dynamic, interesting image, though, if it included something other than the sign.</td>', 'as far as meeting the challenge (signs all around us, telling us what to do), you have done that.  i think it would by a more dynamic, interesting image, though, if it included something other than the sign.', '2004-11-26 05:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033205, 123454, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.  love the lighting and colors, especially love the dof.  this guy is a good symbol of authority.  great perspective, tool.  good luck!</td>', 'beautiful shot.  love the lighting and colors, especially love the dof.  this guy is a good symbol of authority.  great perspective, tool.  good luck!', '2004-11-26 05:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033206, 123394, 23394, '<td valign="top">having two cats, i appreciate the sentiment.  as far as images go, though, this comes across more on the snap-shotty side of things.</td>', 'having two cats, i appreciate the sentiment.  as far as images go, though, this comes across more on the snap-shotty side of things.', '2004-11-26 05:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033207, 123272, 23394, '<td valign="top">not quite sure what to say here.  yes, you have a symbol of authority, and it is also obvious that you have a decent camera.  i also think this image could use some work.  the lighting is fine, except for blowing out the edge of the badge--that is a major distraction--the textures are undone by the badge.  also, i can''t tell what is in the foreground.  it has an interesting pattern, but beyond that, it is not really adding anything to the image.  i think you had the makings of producing a good image, and would definitely recommend revisiting it to see if you could pull out something a bit stronger.</td>', 'not quite sure what to say here.  yes, you have a symbol of authority, and it is also obvious that you have a decent camera.  i also think this image could use some work.  the lighting is fine, except for blowing out the edge of the badge--that is a major distraction--the textures are undone by the badge.  also, i can''t tell what is in the foreground.  it has an interesting pattern, but beyond that, it is not really adding anything to the image.  i think you had the makings of producing a good image, and would definitely recommend revisiting it to see if you could pull out something a bit stronger.', '2004-11-26 05:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033209, 123487, 23394, '<td valign="top">lighting and colors are fine, as is the focus.  i think it would be a bit more demanding with a different ring on the finger.</td>', 'lighting and colors are fine, as is the focus.  i think it would be a bit more demanding with a different ring on the finger.', '2004-11-26 05:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033224, 122219, 24913, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, but what does it have to do wiht authority....</td>', 'Beautiful picture, but what does it have to do wiht authority....', '2004-11-26 07:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033267, 123501, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great image without the hand. Since you refer to the clock (time) as the authority here, the human hand manipulatng it runs counter to your message for me. The angle and framing of the clock works really well. Nice sharp image, which is important in this case because when I think of time, I think of precise and detailed.<br/></td>', 'Great image without the hand. Since you refer to the clock (time) as the authority here, the human hand manipulatng it runs counter to your message for me. The angle and framing of the clock works really well. Nice sharp image, which is important in this case because when I think of time, I think of precise and detailed.', '2004-11-26 09:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033270, 123164, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great image and choice of framing. The viewer''s eye can''t help but be drawn upward and beyond. The point of view is also the perfect choice. Nice job.</td>', 'Great image and choice of framing. The viewer''s eye can''t help but be drawn upward and beyond. The point of view is also the perfect choice. Nice job.', '2004-11-26 09:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033272, 123223, 22384, '<td valign="top">Get sense of humor. The brilliant orange leaves against the black coat of your subject is visual striking. I like that you blew out the whites on the sign, giving it less impact so the viewer''s focus stays with the dog. This photo works well for me.</td>', 'Get sense of humor. The brilliant orange leaves against the black coat of your subject is visual striking. I like that you blew out the whites on the sign, giving it less impact so the viewer''s focus stays with the dog. This photo works well for me.', '2004-11-26 09:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033276, 123315, 22384, '<td valign="top">You certainly get your point across. I would not want to get on the wrong side of this queen unless I was her mother. Then I think I would want to "dethrone" (and I mean that in the figurative sense only)  her as ruler of the domestic domain. You evoked immediate and intense emotion within me, and that is certainly one measure of the success of a piece. Great technical choice in bringing down the brightness and up the contrast so that our focus is exclusively on the subject and the amazing job you did in capturing her expression. Really fantastic image!</td>', 'You certainly get your point across. I would not want to get on the wrong side of this queen unless I was her mother. Then I think I would want to "dethrone" (and I mean that in the figurative sense only)  her as ruler of the domestic domain. You evoked immediate and intense emotion within me, and that is certainly one measure of the success of a piece. Great technical choice in bringing down the brightness and up the contrast so that our focus is exclusively on the subject and the amazing job you did in capturing her expression. Really fantastic image!', '2004-11-26 09:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033277, 123444, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting visual. The dark coin in the middle lower front bothers me because of the negative space it creates. I want an underlying, important coin there, perhaps one that make a political statement.</td>', 'Interesting visual. The dark coin in the middle lower front bothers me because of the negative space it creates. I want an underlying, important coin there, perhaps one that make a political statement.', '2004-11-26 09:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033279, 123295, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, color, and focus on your subject. It would have been nice if you could have gotten rid of the person behind him, but this was basic editing so your options were limited in dealing with that. I like the expression on your subject''s face and also the soft focus on the fans and players behind him. The image works well, except that darn person behind your subject.</td>', 'Nice framing, color, and focus on your subject. It would have been nice if you could have gotten rid of the person behind him, but this was basic editing so your options were limited in dealing with that. I like the expression on your subject''s face and also the soft focus on the fans and players behind him. The image works well, except that darn person behind your subject.', '2004-11-26 09:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033282, 123453, 22384, '<td valign="top">Creative and risky choice in the framing of this image. The harsh light and shadow work well with the intensity of your message. I like that your subject moves off the right side of the frame, but there is a little too much negative space on the left. I know this was an artistic choice and I do like the idea of more negative space there than ususal, it just feel like a little too much so that it takes away from your main visual. Kudos on your courage to risk!</td>', 'Creative and risky choice in the framing of this image. The harsh light and shadow work well with the intensity of your message. I like that your subject moves off the right side of the frame, but there is a little too much negative space on the left. I know this was an artistic choice and I do like the idea of more negative space there than ususal, it just feel like a little too much so that it takes away from your main visual. Kudos on your courage to risk!', '2004-11-26 09:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033283, 122601, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is a brilliant visual. I like the messy room and the vibrant, competing colors. The expression on your subjects'' faces says it all. The hopefulness and admiration of the little one is precious. The use of the ladder to physically show what is happening emotionally and socially between these two is genius. Amazing photo.</td>', 'This is a brilliant visual. I like the messy room and the vibrant, competing colors. The expression on your subjects'' faces says it all. The hopefulness and admiration of the little one is precious. The use of the ladder to physically show what is happening emotionally and socially between these two is genius. Amazing photo.', '2004-11-26 09:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033296, 123314, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, you got my attention!  this is one of those images that hits the mark without having to give it a long look.  great use of bw, nice framing, and great expression on the subject''s face.  this guy looks all business.  good job, and good luck!</td>', 'ok, you got my attention!  this is one of those images that hits the mark without having to give it a long look.  great use of bw, nice framing, and great expression on the subject''s face.  this guy looks all business.  good job, and good luck!', '2004-11-26 09:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033300, 123443, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i get what you''re after (result of authority being applied, as opposed to actually showing authority), i don''t think that was the intent of the challenge.  that aside, the image is fine.  bw gives the image a lot of strength, lighting and focus are on, general composition works well.  <br/> <br/>not sure how you set up the shot, but i would say that if you went to much trouble to capture the image, i wish you would have gone a little further and included an authority figure in the image.  from a scoring standpoint, outside-the-box images usually don''t do that well without a real, real strong tie to the challenge.  with this image, i''ll be surprised if the voters in general will be that generous.  good luck!</td>', 'while i get what you''re after (result of authority being applied, as opposed to actually showing authority), i don''t think that was the intent of the challenge.  that aside, the image is fine.  bw gives the image a lot of strength, lighting and focus are on, general composition works well.   not sure how you set up the shot, but i would say that if you went to much trouble to capture the image, i wish you would have gone a little further and included an authority figure in the image.  from a scoring standpoint, outside-the-box images usually don''t do that well without a real, real strong tie to the challenge.  with this image, i''ll be surprised if the voters in general will be that generous.  good luck!', '2004-11-26 09:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033380, 122902, 27161, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is a picture of.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is a picture of.', '2004-11-26 11:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033391, 123336, 27161, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the reference to white man''s burden.</td>', 'I don''t understand the reference to white man''s burden.', '2004-11-26 11:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033397, 123450, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful portrait of a beautiful woman.  great use of negative space.  would suggest that you might want to completely take out the details in the negative space before delivering a final print.  this is an exquisite piece of work.  don''t know if you shot it with the challenge in mind, but the angle really adds to the impact.  good luck.</td>', 'beautiful portrait of a beautiful woman.  great use of negative space.  would suggest that you might want to completely take out the details in the negative space before delivering a final print.  this is an exquisite piece of work.  don''t know if you shot it with the challenge in mind, but the angle really adds to the impact.  good luck.', '2004-11-26 11:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033400, 123345, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective and lines.  the reflected parking lot is a distraction; a polarizing filter can combat that.</td>', 'interesting perspective and lines.  the reflected parking lot is a distraction; a polarizing filter can combat that.', '2004-11-26 11:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033403, 122797, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i like all the colors in this image, i''m having a hard time finding a subject that really stands out as authority.  the composition doesn''t really zero in on any one specific thing.  maybe if you had swung your camera around and focused in on the guard and the cab driver?</td>', 'while i like all the colors in this image, i''m having a hard time finding a subject that really stands out as authority.  the composition doesn''t really zero in on any one specific thing.  maybe if you had swung your camera around and focused in on the guard and the cab driver?', '2004-11-26 11:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033404, 123290, 23394, '<td valign="top">now that''s a good doggie!  and i bet 10 minutes later she was rolling around, getting stinky again (at least that''s what mine do!).  great colors.  might be a little stronger if cropped in a bit tighter.  wonderful expression, not easy to capture.  as for the challenge, it''s a stretch, and hopefully you won''t be hammered too much along those lines.</td>', 'now that''s a good doggie!  and i bet 10 minutes later she was rolling around, getting stinky again (at least that''s what mine do!).  great colors.  might be a little stronger if cropped in a bit tighter.  wonderful expression, not easy to capture.  as for the challenge, it''s a stretch, and hopefully you won''t be hammered too much along those lines.', '2004-11-26 11:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033409, 122790, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting image.  this is one of the few times that i can accept a border without having to think about it.  really like the the silhoutting, lines, and shapes, and the way the red light stands out.  interesting take on the challenge.   good luck.</td>', 'interesting image.  this is one of the few times that i can accept a border without having to think about it.  really like the the silhoutting, lines, and shapes, and the way the red light stands out.  interesting take on the challenge.   good luck.', '2004-11-26 12:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033450, 123055, 24715, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2004-11-26 12:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033455, 123289, 21892, '<td valign="top">At first it appears as though the dog''s head is being served on a plate. Upon further review, good interpretation.</td>', 'At first it appears as though the dog''s head is being served on a plate. Upon further review, good interpretation.', '2004-11-26 13:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033456, 123509, 21892, '<td valign="top">Good idea but that doesn''t look like a very desirable beach.</td>', 'Good idea but that doesn''t look like a very desirable beach.', '2004-11-26 13:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033457, 123432, 21892, '<td valign="top">Math''s.</td>', 'Math''s.', '2004-11-26 13:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033458, 123299, 21892, '<td valign="top">Way too dramatic. The belt should be the focus of the picture.</td>', 'Way too dramatic. The belt should be the focus of the picture.', '2004-11-26 13:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033472, 123512, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice tone + DOF. The vignetting might work better without the darkness in the top left.</td>', 'Nice tone + DOF. The vignetting might work better without the darkness in the top left.', '2004-11-26 13:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033473, 123483, 28003, '<td valign="top">Needs more DOF - blurry foreground objects are bad.</td>', 'Needs more DOF - blurry foreground objects are bad.', '2004-11-26 13:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033474, 123343, 23394, '<td valign="top">if i strip away the title and did not know what the challenge was, authority would never cross my mind.  i would be left with a nice bw image, nicely lit and sharply focused.</td>', 'if i strip away the title and did not know what the challenge was, authority would never cross my mind.  i would be left with a nice bw image, nicely lit and sharply focused.', '2004-11-26 13:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033477, 122285, 28003, '<td valign="top">Haha... what?</td>', 'Haha... what?', '2004-11-26 13:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033478, 123495, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, could be made a bit more dynamic if sign was more to the right (but then again, that would mean you''d probably have to be out in the road, which could be dangerous, especially if another fedex truck was coming up behind you.  then again, those are the risk that go with challenge shooting).</td>', 'interesting shot, could be made a bit more dynamic if sign was more to the right (but then again, that would mean you''d probably have to be out in the road, which could be dangerous, especially if another fedex truck was coming up behind you.  then again, those are the risk that go with challenge shooting).', '2004-11-26 13:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033481, 123512, 23394, '<td valign="top">the big question for me is, "did you write the text, or did you find it somewhere?"  this could have been a killer entry, if you had rotated the signature into the bottom right, and had included a bit more funny, authoritative text (like "failure to comply will result in forfeiture of first born son...").  shallow dof also takes away from inviting viewer to read deeper into the image.  keep in mind, scoring here is a matter of grabbing and keeping voter attention, not allowing them to view and click away.  all the same, i like your take on the challenge, and wish you good luck.</td>', 'the big question for me is, "did you write the text, or did you find it somewhere?"  this could have been a killer entry, if you had rotated the signature into the bottom right, and had included a bit more funny, authoritative text (like "failure to comply will result in forfeiture of first born son...").  shallow dof also takes away from inviting viewer to read deeper into the image.  keep in mind, scoring here is a matter of grabbing and keeping voter attention, not allowing them to view and click away.  all the same, i like your take on the challenge, and wish you good luck.', '2004-11-26 13:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033482, 123538, 23394, '<td valign="top">funny.  would have been funnier with a cow in the shot.</td>', 'funny.  would have been funnier with a cow in the shot.', '2004-11-26 13:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033484, 123513, 23394, '<td valign="top">the finger is too indistinguished from the clutter to stand out as a subject.  without that, this image really struggles to meet the challenge.  maybe if it had been shot in portrait mode with the lighting casting the shadow up on the wall it would have come across stronger.</td>', 'the finger is too indistinguished from the clutter to stand out as a subject.  without that, this image really struggles to meet the challenge.  maybe if it had been shot in portrait mode with the lighting casting the shadow up on the wall it would have come across stronger.', '2004-11-26 13:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033485, 122756, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge.  would probably be a stronger entry if angled and cropped to accentuate the subject (when holding my hand up, the bottom half of the image looks pretty good, by itself.).</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge.  would probably be a stronger entry if angled and cropped to accentuate the subject (when holding my hand up, the bottom half of the image looks pretty good, by itself.).', '2004-11-26 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033486, 122902, 28858, '<td valign="top">What does it represent?</td>', 'What does it represent?', '2004-11-26 13:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033487, 123510, 28858, '<td valign="top">Soft focus/Red Eye</td>', 'Soft focus/Red Eye', '2004-11-26 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033513, 123016, 11691, '<td valign="top">there are far too many shots of signs this week,  yours is the best one though, it has some added interestbeing in a different language.</td>', 'there are far too many shots of signs this week,  yours is the best one though, it has some added interestbeing in a different language.', '2004-11-26 14:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033514, 123454, 11691, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, you seemed to get the perfect angle to demonstrate its authority.</td>', 'I really like this picture, you seemed to get the perfect angle to demonstrate its authority.', '2004-11-26 14:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033516, 123515, 11691, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy archetecture shots.  very interestiong light source.</td>', 'I really enjoy archetecture shots.  very interestiong light source.', '2004-11-26 14:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033518, 122760, 11691, '<td valign="top">That great big launcher thingy really tells you not to piss this guy off</td>', 'That great big launcher thingy really tells you not to piss this guy off', '2004-11-26 14:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033530, 122241, 12611, '<td valign="top">A little too cropped and/or digitized. pretty good though.</td>', 'A little too cropped and/or digitized. pretty good though.', '2004-11-26 15:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033532, 122469, 12611, '<td valign="top">digitized, busy, and a reddish purple cast. Nice pergo though.</td>', 'digitized, busy, and a reddish purple cast. Nice pergo though.', '2004-11-26 15:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033533, 123298, 12611, '<td valign="top">nice green water and pale bricks. a little bit literal for my taste.</td>', 'nice green water and pale bricks. a little bit literal for my taste.', '2004-11-26 15:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033534, 123253, 12611, '<td valign="top">alternate title, "testing out camera in police parking lot." nice crisp colors.</td>', 'alternate title, "testing out camera in police parking lot." nice crisp colors.', '2004-11-26 15:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033537, 123034, 12611, '<td valign="top">kind of goofy an dfunny, the picture, otherwise,  is nicely composed. Funny thing is that most people don''t frame it to INCLUDE the sign, but because of teh challenge you did, and it worked out.</td>', 'kind of goofy an dfunny, the picture, otherwise,  is nicely composed. Funny thing is that most people don''t frame it to INCLUDE the sign, but because of teh challenge you did, and it worked out.', '2004-11-26 15:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033538, 123515, 12611, '<td valign="top">nice subtle lighting. very ionic.</td>', 'nice subtle lighting. very ionic.', '2004-11-26 15:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033539, 122555, 12611, '<td valign="top">awesome vibrant colors. demerits for the dizzying composition angle.</td>', 'awesome vibrant colors. demerits for the dizzying composition angle.', '2004-11-26 15:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033541, 123055, 12611, '<td valign="top">looks like me before coffee on monday. This fella has to work on his pecs a bit. nice shot.</td>', 'looks like me before coffee on monday. This fella has to work on his pecs a bit. nice shot.', '2004-11-26 15:40:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1033543, 123455, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice color. clever too.</td>', 'Nice color. clever too.', '2004-11-26 15:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033545, 123405, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, clear compositional goals. good job.</td>', 'Nice focus, clear compositional goals. good job.', '2004-11-26 15:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033547, 123295, 12611, '<td valign="top">"Hey- I''ll take a hot chocolate" would have been a great title. nice shot given the fact that you can''t control the annoying  guy in the green.</td>', '"Hey- I''ll take a hot chocolate" would have been a great title. nice shot given the fact that you can''t control the annoying  guy in the green.', '2004-11-26 15:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033549, 122782, 12611, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to say. THis is a nice shot but completely contrived. good luck.</td>', 'I don''t know what to say. THis is a nice shot but completely contrived. good luck.', '2004-11-26 15:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033550, 123508, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is very very bizarre- you should get to the psychiatrist soon.<br/>Is that a girl? I''m in shock.</td>', 'This is very very bizarre- you should get to the psychiatrist soon.Is that a girl? I''m in shock.', '2004-11-26 15:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033552, 123345, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast. Me likey.</td>', 'Nice contrast. Me likey.', '2004-11-26 15:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033553, 123217, 12611, '<td valign="top">oooh scary. What makes it particularly emotional is that the guy is wearing cargo pants. and the scariest of villians always dress a few years out of style!</td>', 'oooh scary. What makes it particularly emotional is that the guy is wearing cargo pants. and the scariest of villians always dress a few years out of style!', '2004-11-26 15:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033554, 123360, 12611, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast in the face, a touch sharper focus. and you have a winner.</td>', 'A little more contrast in the face, a touch sharper focus. and you have a winner.', '2004-11-26 15:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033555, 122538, 12611, '<td valign="top">Authority? Heck yeah!  I can''t tell if you have destroyed one of my fantasies, or created a new one!</td>', 'Authority? Heck yeah!  I can''t tell if you have destroyed one of my fantasies, or created a new one!', '2004-11-26 15:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033557, 122905, 12611, '<td valign="top">kudos for arranging this shot. THats a heavy suty ruler too- holy crow! I''d like to see shots of the punishment.- now that would be a ten!</td>', 'kudos for arranging this shot. THats a heavy suty ruler too- holy crow! I''d like to see shots of the punishment.- now that would be a ten!', '2004-11-26 15:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1033558, 123299, 12611, '<td valign="top">horrible title.</td>', 'horrible title.', '2004-11-26 15:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
