(1034005, 123454, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wow, you took this picture at the exact right time of day, the lighting is perfect. The perspective gives an imposing feel to the statue. I don''t really know how I feel about pictures of sculptures - this image is, after all, basically a representation of someone else''s art. But overall, I think the great lighting and perspective take it far enough away from a "literal representation" to deserve a high score. 8.<br/></td>', 'Wow, you took this picture at the exact right time of day, the lighting is perfect. The perspective gives an imposing feel to the statue. I don''t really know how I feel about pictures of sculptures - this image is, after all, basically a representation of someone else''s art. But overall, I think the great lighting and perspective take it far enough away from a "literal representation" to deserve a high score. 8.', '2004-11-27 03:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034006, 123345, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone here, but there isn''t much to set this apart from the other squad car/ law enforcement type pictures. I guess it''s not the easiest challenge to surprise people with an inventive idea. 6.<br/> <br/>Good Luck!</td>', 'I like the sepia tone here, but there isn''t much to set this apart from the other squad car/ law enforcement type pictures. I guess it''s not the easiest challenge to surprise people with an inventive idea. 6. Good Luck!', '2004-11-27 03:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
