(1034223, 122790, 9437, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally like silhouette shots, but this one is very well done. I especially like the offset of the darkening pink sky and the brilliance of the water. Bot elements work together to bring the "subject" forward. Good Job. --10</td>', 'I don''t normally like silhouette shots, but this one is very well done. I especially like the offset of the darkening pink sky and the brilliance of the water. Bot elements work together to bring the "subject" forward. Good Job. --10', '2004-11-27 12:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034225, 123446, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like that you represented authority as a shadow. It gives the idea of auhtority something misterious, vague, uncomprehensible. The boys shadow doesn''t add to the atmosphere, though. Perhaps a different position of the light woulld have cast his shadow outside of the image.<br/>I particularly like the boy''s attitude, the way he looks at the floor clearly shows that he has no other choice but to accept his parents'' order. A great image on the whole.</td>', 'I like that you represented authority as a shadow. It gives the idea of auhtority something misterious, vague, uncomprehensible. The boys shadow doesn''t add to the atmosphere, though. Perhaps a different position of the light woulld have cast his shadow outside of the image.I particularly like the boy''s attitude, the way he looks at the floor clearly shows that he has no other choice but to accept his parents'' order. A great image on the whole.', '2004-11-27 12:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
