(1034477, 123505, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a tough shot for the challenge.  as the sign is not really the subject, the image relies on the title for a point of reference.  maybe if you had set up the shot slightly to the left, or had cropped out the person with the unbrella.  just a slight change in perspective could make all the difference in the world.</td>', 'this is a tough shot for the challenge.  as the sign is not really the subject, the image relies on the title for a point of reference.  maybe if you had set up the shot slightly to the left, or had cropped out the person with the unbrella.  just a slight change in perspective could make all the difference in the world.', '2004-11-27 18:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
