(1034804, 123289, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is very cute. I am partial to pooches and this guy just looks miserable (which goes well with this particular challenge).<br/> <br/>Technical: Focus, DOF, and exposure is good. Image could have been sharpened a hair.<br/>Artistic: The angle and the crop is good. The red background is too dominant. Takes the focus away from the subject.<br/> <br/>Overall: I think this fits the theme well and is overall a good entry. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is very cute. I am partial to pooches and this guy just looks miserable (which goes well with this particular challenge). Technical: Focus, DOF, and exposure is good. Image could have been sharpened a hair.Artistic: The angle and the crop is good. The red background is too dominant. Takes the focus away from the subject. Overall: I think this fits the theme well and is overall a good entry. Bumping up.', '2004-11-28 04:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034805, 123000, 22479, '<td valign="top">Good use of selective desaturation. Makes the image rather spooky.<br/> <br/>I don''t think there is a strong connection to authority, more symbolic.<br/> <br/>Technical: Sharpness, exposure, and contrast is good.<br/>Artistic: Again, very tastefully executed. Good perspective and crop.<br/> <br/>Overall: This is a great photo that unfortunately does not make a strong connection with the challenge theme.</td>', 'Good use of selective desaturation. Makes the image rather spooky. I don''t think there is a strong connection to authority, more symbolic. Technical: Sharpness, exposure, and contrast is good.Artistic: Again, very tastefully executed. Good perspective and crop. Overall: This is a great photo that unfortunately does not make a strong connection with the challenge theme.', '2004-11-28 04:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034807, 123217, 22479, '<td valign="top">Clever. Dramatic. Spooky. There is no strong connection with the challenge theme however.<br/> <br/>Technical: good use of lighting and contrast. Sharp, and in focus.<br/>Artistic: I think the person''s red hooded coat distracts somewhat...if he was in a black hooded coat, now that would be really spooky. Otherwise, there is a nice use of lines, geometric shapes and I think the perspective and crop really works well.<br/> <br/>Overall, this is a good photo but suffers from a lack of strong connection with the challenge theme.</td>', 'Clever. Dramatic. Spooky. There is no strong connection with the challenge theme however. Technical: good use of lighting and contrast. Sharp, and in focus.Artistic: I think the person''s red hooded coat distracts somewhat...if he was in a black hooded coat, now that would be really spooky. Otherwise, there is a nice use of lines, geometric shapes and I think the perspective and crop really works well. Overall, this is a good photo but suffers from a lack of strong connection with the challenge theme.', '2004-11-28 04:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034808, 122391, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on her face. She is saying, "I''m confident and in control". Good capture of a performance.</td>', 'I like the expression on her face. She is saying, "I''m confident and in control". Good capture of a performance.', '2004-11-28 05:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034809, 123318, 22479, '<td valign="top">Somewhat subdued, but probably as an artistic gesture, which is okay. <br/> <br/>Sharp, in focus. I''m not sure the perspective works here. I think I would have shot it at a different angle. Overall a good entry.<br/></td>', 'Somewhat subdued, but probably as an artistic gesture, which is okay.  Sharp, in focus. I''m not sure the perspective works here. I think I would have shot it at a different angle. Overall a good entry.', '2004-11-28 05:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1034810, 122419, 13749, '<td valign="top">nice perspective, could''ve possibly reshot without the cat hairs on the left, and improved the colors in photoshop.  very creative though, i like it.  would have possibly removed the watch, as my focus tends to go there for some reason.</td>', 'nice perspective, could''ve possibly reshot without the cat hairs on the left, and improved the colors in photoshop.  very creative though, i like it.  would have possibly removed the watch, as my focus tends to go there for some reason.', '2004-11-28 05:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
