(1035329, 123000, 22384, '<td valign="top">Scary concept. I would have liked to been able to read the signs, so I would have cropped this closer and maybe had a face looking out from one of the windows to up the intensity. I was almost afraid to look too closely at the windows for fear that that is precisely what I would see.</td>', 'Scary concept. I would have liked to been able to read the signs, so I would have cropped this closer and maybe had a face looking out from one of the windows to up the intensity. I was almost afraid to look too closely at the windows for fear that that is precisely what I would see.', '2004-11-28 20:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
