(1037464, 122826, 28742, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, but the staging is not great quality. Suggestions: a non-porous surface so the spilled Kahlua can be seen in a glossy puddle. set the backdrop much further back so as to obscure it completely. I would adjust the angle so the vodka bottle''s sides are perfectly vertical. Good work overall though.</td>', 'I like this concept, but the staging is not great quality. Suggestions: a non-porous surface so the spilled Kahlua can be seen in a glossy puddle. set the backdrop much further back so as to obscure it completely. I would adjust the angle so the vodka bottle''s sides are perfectly vertical. Good work overall though.', '2004-11-30 02:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037467, 122419, 28742, '<td valign="top">Can''t...  ...breathe... he''s... standing on my chest.  ;-)<br/>I mighta liked this cropped above his knees to give the view of a small child instead of a cockroach. And would like to not see the background wall/ceiling lines.</td>', 'Can''t...  ...breathe... he''s... standing on my chest.  ;-)I mighta liked this cropped above his knees to give the view of a small child instead of a cockroach. And would like to not see the background wall/ceiling lines.', '2004-11-30 02:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
