(1039043, 122532, 23362, '<td valign="top">Striking image...lots of mood from the play of the lighting, worn book, and  it''s just simply well done. Certainly the source of authority for those that worship from these pages.</td>', 'Striking image...lots of mood from the play of the lighting, worn book, and  it''s just simply well done. Certainly the source of authority for those that worship from these pages.', '2004-11-30 19:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
