(1039057, 123314, 29777, '<td valign="top">very good. Powerful image. I''m finally beginning to see how some images look better in B&amp;W.</td>', 'very good. Powerful image. I''m finally beginning to see how some images look better in B&W.', '2004-11-30 20:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039061, 123512, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like this. It would be nice if the text was clearer all the way to the edge of the image.</td>', 'I like this. It would be nice if the text was clearer all the way to the edge of the image.', '2004-11-30 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039062, 123391, 23362, '<td valign="top">I think ho-hum to the topic but as I don''t see much support to the "authority" of the U.S. flag from the "authority" of an even taller light house.  Perhaps if we had a U.S. Flag next to some kind of figure or symbol of authority it would come off with more impact.</td>', 'I think ho-hum to the topic but as I don''t see much support to the "authority" of the U.S. flag from the "authority" of an even taller light house.  Perhaps if we had a U.S. Flag next to some kind of figure or symbol of authority it would come off with more impact.', '2004-11-30 20:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039065, 122681, 23362, '<td valign="top">If it were a ref in someones face...that would show authority, but the ref picking up a penality flag doesn''t ring my bell.</td>', 'If it were a ref in someones face...that would show authority, but the ref picking up a penality flag doesn''t ring my bell.', '2004-11-30 20:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
