(1039086, 122219, 23362, '<td valign="top">Another sunset?  Maybe one could add an American Flag and a couple hands shaking with a puppy sitting watching and looking sad and how about adding a...?</td>', 'Another sunset?  Maybe one could add an American Flag and a couple hands shaking with a puppy sitting watching and looking sad and how about adding a...?', '2004-11-30 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
