(1039414, 123446, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your 5th place finish Skip.  I keep telling them to give out at least 6 ribbons each time.  They keep saying they can''t afford all those ribbons.  ;)</td>', 'Congrats on your 5th place finish Skip.  I keep telling them to give out at least 6 ribbons each time.  They keep saying they can''t afford all those ribbons.  ;)', '2004-12-01 00:10:14.000000', NULL, 0),
