(1039419, 123446, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 5th finish. A very strong image with both the tender tones of submission and parental authority. Here you created a poem of an image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 5th finish. A very strong image with both the tender tones of submission and parental authority. Here you created a poem of an image.', '2004-12-01 00:11:49.000000', NULL, 0),
