(1039426, 123517, 19408, '<td valign="top">The source of authority was supposed to be the traffic lights as they tell us what to do and we obey unconsciously. I didn''t have quite the zoom necessary to enlarge it to make it prominent enough to be the subject however.</td>', 'The source of authority was supposed to be the traffic lights as they tell us what to do and we obey unconsciously. I didn''t have quite the zoom necessary to enlarge it to make it prominent enough to be the subject however.', '2004-12-01 00:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
