(1039498, 123207, 4380, '<td valign="top">im so dissapointed to see this image ranking below the top 10.... this is my top pick for the challenge.congrats on your excellent image... and there''s no wrong with the border.... TAKE A BOW!!! <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-01 00:33:01.</i></td>', 'im so dissapointed to see this image ranking below the top 10.... this is my top pick for the challenge.congrats on your excellent image... and there''s no wrong with the border.... TAKE A BOW!!! ', '2004-12-01 00:30:12.000000', '2004-12-01 00:33:01.000000', 0),
