(1039595, 122419, 22734, '<td valign="top">I feel gypped. I thought the voters would have favored this image to its deserving place. I figured easy top 5. I feel very insecure when I see a good image that I think should be top 5 get tossed on the side. Keep it up, the talent is there.</td>', 'I feel gypped. I thought the voters would have favored this image to its deserving place. I figured easy top 5. I feel very insecure when I see a good image that I think should be top 5 get tossed on the side. Keep it up, the talent is there.', '2004-12-01 00:49:37.000000', NULL, 0),
