(1039620, 123299, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a real shame that this photo got all those ones, twos, and threes.  The point of good photography is not always "feel good" images - sadly lost on so many here at DPC.  This should have been a top 10 in my book.</td>', 'I think it''s a real shame that this photo got all those ones, twos, and threes.  The point of good photography is not always "feel good" images - sadly lost on so many here at DPC.  This should have been a top 10 in my book.', '2004-12-01 00:53:07.000000', NULL, 0),
