(1039842, 123531, 25952, '<td valign="top">at least i got some strong reactions haha<br/>"This makes me feel like an abused child. The facial expression, point of view and distortion at the top of this image makes it horrifying. Interesting symbolism with the broom." that made me laugh!</td>', 'at least i got some strong reactions haha"This makes me feel like an abused child. The facial expression, point of view and distortion at the top of this image makes it horrifying. Interesting symbolism with the broom." that made me laugh!', '2004-12-01 01:57:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1039852, 123539, 28961, '<td valign="top">ok, i didnt want to put the idea in the title cos i wanted to make people think about it rather than giving it away. its based on the game Paper Scissors Stone (rock paper scissors for the americans). it was a last minute pic, and i submitted it 2 minutes before the deadline, so i didnt have too much time for composition, angles, lighting etc. the theme was authority and whether this showed the lack of authority or not, it still (to me) shows authority of some kind. they each have authority over the other in the sense that they can each win. hope this clears things up a bit.  thanks for the comments!<br/> <br/>frank</td>', 'ok, i didnt want to put the idea in the title cos i wanted to make people think about it rather than giving it away. its based on the game Paper Scissors Stone (rock paper scissors for the americans). it was a last minute pic, and i submitted it 2 minutes before the deadline, so i didnt have too much time for composition, angles, lighting etc. the theme was authority and whether this showed the lack of authority or not, it still (to me) shows authority of some kind. they each have authority over the other in the sense that they can each win. hope this clears things up a bit.  thanks for the comments! frank', '2004-12-01 02:00:15.000000', NULL, 0),
