(1040038, 122538, 22479, '<td valign="top">I''m disappointed this did not do better. I think you had one of the most interesting shots in this challenge. Oh well, ya win some, ya lose some.</td>', 'I''m disappointed this did not do better. I think you had one of the most interesting shots in this challenge. Oh well, ya win some, ya lose some.', '2004-12-01 03:02:47.000000', NULL, 0),
