(1040072, 123446, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great job skip! Congratulations and all the best.</td>', 'Great job skip! Congratulations and all the best.', '2004-12-01 03:14:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1040137, 123432, 27440, '<td valign="top">Hello there :) I am glad you liked the picture and I am glad that those who didn''t like it, said what''s wrong about it. <br/> <br/>Greslizzz this is exactly what I was going for. My teacher caught in the act of creating. His hand is dynamic in opposition to mathematics which is static and calm to me :) It took me 3/4 of the lecture to achieve this motion blur:) I had great fun watching your comments that went:<br/> <br/>-I like the motion blur<br/>-I don''t like the motion blur<br/>-I like the motion blur<br/>-I don''t like the motion blur <br/>:)<br/> <br/>Some people commented that they see no rules here... so now my explenation :)<br/> <br/>Mathematics are abundanat in rules, regulations, restrictions, statements  and different laws. So I thought it was a primary expamle of rules. Afterall everybody obeys them - not even knowing about this! Hell, our world we know today requires maths.<br/> <br/>Graphicfunk I am so flattered hearing such words :) <br/>Even more flattered hearing such words from a man like you BIG THANKS.<br/> <br/>Thank you all for voting. I received no ones ! :)</td>', 'Hello there :) I am glad you liked the picture and I am glad that those who didn''t like it, said what''s wrong about it.  Greslizzz this is exactly what I was going for. My teacher caught in the act of creating. His hand is dynamic in opposition to mathematics which is static and calm to me :) It took me 3/4 of the lecture to achieve this motion blur:) I had great fun watching your comments that went: -I like the motion blur-I don''t like the motion blur-I like the motion blur-I don''t like the motion blur :) Some people commented that they see no rules here... so now my explenation :) Mathematics are abundanat in rules, regulations, restrictions, statements  and different laws. So I thought it was a primary expamle of rules. Afterall everybody obeys them - not even knowing about this! Hell, our world we know today requires maths. Graphicfunk I am so flattered hearing such words :) Even more flattered hearing such words from a man like you BIG THANKS. Thank you all for voting. I received no ones ! :)', '2004-12-01 03:59:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1040140, 123395, 27440, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 10. I love it. This man looks like a man with authority. He''s eyes seem so full of wisdome and his face in combination with the shadows and the sephia/b&amp;w make him so calm. As if he knew what could happen and how to react. So sure of him self but in a good way. One of my favourites.<br/> <br/>I swear I commented on this one.. :P Now where did my comment go :P</td>', 'I gave it a 10. I love it. This man looks like a man with authority. He''s eyes seem so full of wisdome and his face in combination with the shadows and the sephia/b&w make him so calm. As if he knew what could happen and how to react. So sure of him self but in a good way. One of my favourites. I swear I commented on this one.. :P Now where did my comment go :P', '2004-12-01 04:06:38.000000', NULL, 0),
