(1040221, 123443, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a striking image that causes the viewer to try to imagine the story behind the bars. Technically the picture is excellent. As in many of the other challenges good pictures that depict violence or are a little on the "dark" side do not do as well. This one should have done much better in the voting.</td>', 'This is a striking image that causes the viewer to try to imagine the story behind the bars. Technically the picture is excellent. As in many of the other challenges good pictures that depict violence or are a little on the "dark" side do not do as well. This one should have done much better in the voting.', '2004-12-01 06:16:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1040236, 122219, 29535, '<td valign="top">Personally this should have finished much higher.  It''s a disappointment how people overlook menaing in photos as they vote, leading to deeper ideas and great pictures being completely overlooked by the entire community.<br/> <br/>The sun DOES have authoirty, over us.  hen it sets, we are plunged into night.  We can''t control the sun. it controls us.  It makes us sleep, it darkens the world, it controls our lives.  THATS authority.</td>', 'Personally this should have finished much higher.  It''s a disappointment how people overlook menaing in photos as they vote, leading to deeper ideas and great pictures being completely overlooked by the entire community. The sun DOES have authoirty, over us.  hen it sets, we are plunged into night.  We can''t control the sun. it controls us.  It makes us sleep, it darkens the world, it controls our lives.  THATS authority.', '2004-12-01 06:28:26.000000', NULL, 0),
