(1044493, 123507, 7364, '<td valign="top">Thank you for submitting a quality high contrast photo.  I rated this photo very high and am glad it ribboned.  I''ve seen so may people submit a crappy photo with high contrast, noise, or some other gimmik then they whined because they scored low claiming people on this site don''t like a photo if it''s not someone''s kid or puppy.  Thank you for showing us the right way to do it!</td>', 'Thank you for submitting a quality high contrast photo.  I rated this photo very high and am glad it ribboned.  I''ve seen so may people submit a crappy photo with high contrast, noise, or some other gimmik then they whined because they scored low claiming people on this site don''t like a photo if it''s not someone''s kid or puppy.  Thank you for showing us the right way to do it!', '2004-12-03 09:55:32.000000', NULL, 0),
